<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Kutu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito yandikigwe na Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito yandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maluko</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Maluko ya mumkumbo wa vitabu vine va lagano da sambi, vitabu avo volagusa vija Yesu viyakalile hano mwiisi. Kila kitabu acho chokemigwa, “Injili,” fambulo jake Mbuli Inogile. Vitabu avo vandikigwa ako kumwande na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana kipindi Yesu viyafile na kuzilibuka. Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Maluko acho kitabu kiguhi mna ivitabu vine va Mbuli Inogile. Vivija chogesigwa kamba acho kitabu cha ichanduso kwandikigwa mna ivitabu vose va Mbuli Inogile. Yogesigwa chandikigwa mwaka 65-70 toka kuvumbuka kwa Kilisito. Wanhu wengi oifunza vinhu ogesa kamba chandikigwa Lumi kwa kilamuso cha kuwagela moyo wanhu wamtogole Yesu ako.</para>
  <para style="ip">Vivija Maluko kokemigwa Yohana Maluko, kakala miyao na mtumigwa Paulo na Balinaba, lakini mbuli ziyalongigwe vihile mbuli yake hazoneke kipindi viyawalekile muumwanza wa kimishieni. (Sang'h 13:13). Abaho Maluko kanga kabili na Balinaba (Sang'h 15:37-39). Vivija Maluko kajuwika kamba kakala uki na kidole na Petulo (1 Pet 5:13). Hamoja Maluko hazone kwa meso mbuli za Yesu viyakalile mwiisi, wanhu oifunza vinhu ogesa kamba Maluko kandika mbuli nyingi ziyone Petulo na azo mbuli zimemile mna Imbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Maluko. Mna Imbuli Inogile, Maluko kalonga ng'hani mbuli za uwanahina na mafundizo ga Yesu mna ikipindi cha kimambukizo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili mkitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Maluko kosonga ikitabu mna isula ya 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho Maluko kosimulila sang'hano ya Yesu viyakalile ako Galilaya (Sula ya 1:14-8:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho kolonga mbuli ya mwanza wa Yesu ako Yelusalemu (Sula ya 8:22-10:52).</para>
  <para style="io">Maluko komambukiza kwa kwandika mbuli ya kipindi cha Yesu ako Yelusalemu, na komambukiza na ifa yake na kuzilibuka (Sula ya 11:1-16:8).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizaji kowapetela wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Ino ayo Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito Mkombola, Mwana wa Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Isonga kamba viyandikigwe na mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Imulungu kalonga, ‘Nomtuma msenga wangu yakulongolele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">yaitande nzila yako.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Munhu imoja kokema kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Itandeni nzila ya Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">goloseni nzila yake yonda yabite!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Yohana Mbatizaji kalawilila kuluwala kawapetela wanhu, “Lekeni nzambi na mbatizigwe na Imulungu kozigela kumgongo nzambi zenu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Wanhu wengi kulawa mwiisi ya Yudea na kudibuga da Yelusalemu wachola kumtegeleza Yohana. Watogola kamba wana nzambi, Yohana kawabatiza muulwanda lwa Yolidani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Yohana kavala kiwalo kitendigwe kwa mibahila ya ngamiya na mkwiji wa ng'hwembe mkigudi chake, ndiya yake ikala nzige na uki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Kawapetela wanhu, “Munhu yonda yeze kuchugu kumwangu heyo munhu mkulu kunibanza nene. Niye sifaya hata kudohola nzabi za vilatu vake. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Niye nowabatiza kwa mazi, lakini heyo kowabatiza kwa Loho Yang'alile.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatizigwa na kugezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matayo 3:13-4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Mna ikipindi acho Yesu kalawa mna ikijiji cha Nazaleti mwiisi ya Galilaya na Yohana kambatiza muulwanda lwa Yolidani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Yesu viyalawile mgamazi, bahaja kawona ulanga ugubuka na kamona Loho Yang'alile kohumuluka kamba huwa na kakala uchanha yake. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Sauti ihulikigwa kulawa kuulanga ilonga, “Gweye kwa Mwanangu nikunogele. Ninogelwa na gweye.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Bahaja Loho Yang'alile kamulongoza yachole kuluwala, <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>kakala kuko kuluwala siku malongo mane, kagezigwa na Mwenembago. Wanyama wa kumuhulo wakala aho lakini wasenga wa kuulanga weza wamsang'hanila.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema wavula somba wane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matayo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Yohana viyagodekigwe mkifungo, Yesu kachola isi ya Galilaya, kawapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile ya Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Kalonga, “Kipindi kivika, Undewa wa Imulungu wammabehi! Lekeni nzambi na muitogole Mbuli Inogile!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Yesu viyakalile kobita kumgwazo wa lamba da Galilaya kawavika wavula somba wabili, Simoni na mdodo wake Andeleya wakala ovula somba na mizavu yao.<figure style="fig" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" ref="1:16">Munhu kovula somba kwa lwavu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nikwelelezeni, na niye nowatenda muwe wavulaji wa wanhu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Bahaja waileka mizavu yao, wamkweleleza.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Kagenda kumwande, kawavika ndugu wabili wayagwe. Yakobo na Yohana, wanage Zebedayo. Wakala mwiingalawa oitanda mizavu yao. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Bahaja Yesu viyawone kawakema, nao wamuleka tatao Zebedayo na wasang'hanaji zake mwiingalawa, wamkweleleza Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yeli na kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wavika kudibuga da Kapelinaumu, viivikile siku ya Kubwihila Yesu kengila mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu, kasonga kufundiza. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Wanhu wamuhulike wakanganya mafundizo gake, kwavija hafundize kamba wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, ila kafundiza kwa udahi.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Abaho munhu yakalile na kinyamkela kengila mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu, kaguta, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>“Vino, kolonda choni kumwetu, gweye Yesu wa Nazaleti? Kwiza kutukoma? Nokujuwa gweye kwa ija Yang'alile yatumigwe na Imulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yesu kamkomhokela ikinyamkela, “Nyamala! Mulawe munhu ino!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Kinyamkela kamgela kisango munhu ayo, kaguta nyangi, kamulawa. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya ng'hani, avo wasonga kuilongela, “Vino kino choni? Mafundizo gano ga sambi! Munhu ino kana udahi wa kulava vinyamkela, nao omtegeleza!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Avo mbuli za Yesu zibwililika himahima kila hanhu mwiisi ya Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Yesu na wanahina zake, hamoja na Yakobo na Yohana walawa mna ing'anda ya kumpula Imulungu, wachola kuna ikae ya Simoni na Andeleya. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Mkwe wa kitwanzi wa Simoni kakala yawasile mulusazi kolumwa homa, Yesu viyavikile wamulongela mbuli za mtamu ayo. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Yesu kamgendela mtwanzi ayo, kamgoga mkono kamwinula. Homa imulawa na kasonga kuwasang'hanila.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Ichungulo, zuwa vidihongile, wanhu wamgalila Yesu watamu na waja wakalile na vinyamkela. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Wanhu wose wa kudibuga dija waiting'hana haluhelengo lwa ing'anda. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Yesu kawahonya wanhu wengi wakalile na mitamu na kawalava vinyamkela wengi. Hawalekile vinyamkela walonge kwavija wamjuwa kakala nani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela wanhu ako Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Imitootondo ng'hani siku diyagwe, Yesu kalamuka kasegela, kachola kunze kudibuga, hanhu kuduhu wanhu, kuko kampula Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simoni na wayage wachola kumzahila, <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>viwamvikile wamulongela, “Kila munhu kokuzahila.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Yesu kawedika, “Tolondigwa kuchola kuna ivijiji viyagwe vili behi. Ako nako nolondigwa kuwapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile, kwavija acho kiminzile.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Yesu kachola kila hanhu mwiisi ya Galilaya, kawapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile mzing'anda za kumpula Imulungu na kulava vinyamkela.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Munhu imoja yeli na utamu wa dikulu kamgendela Yesu, kamfugamila, kampula, kalonga, “Wahalonda kodaha kunihonya.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yesu kamonela bazi, kamgolosela mkono, kamkwasa, kalonga, “Nolonda, hona!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Bahaja utamu umulawa, kahona. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Yesu kamulongela yachole, kamzuma, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>kamulongela, “Tegeleza, sikuumulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ino, lakini goga inzila mbaka kwa mulava nhosa, yakakulolese lolese. Abaho kalave nhosa kamba viyalagize Musa ili kutenda kila munhu yatogole kamba kuhonyigwa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Lakini munhu ayo kasegela, kasonga kuzibwililisa mbuli azo kila hanhu, kalonga mbuli nyingi mbaka Yesu hadahile kwingila mwiisi kunze kunze. Avo Yesu kakala kunze hanhu kuduhu wanhu, lakini wanhu wamcholela kulawa kila hanhu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yaholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Hazibitile siku nyingi, Yesu kabwela Kapelinaumu, mbuli zibwililika kwa wanhu kamba kakala ukae. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Wanhu wengi waiting'hana hamoja mbaka kukala kuduhu gati disigale, wamema mbaka kuluhelengo. Yesu kakala kowapetela mbuli. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Abaho weza wanhu wane, wampapile munhu yaholole walonda kumgala kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Kwavija kukala na lunhu, hawadahile bule kumgala kwa Yesu. Avo watobola zonzo kukiswili uchanha ya aho haakalile Yesu, wahumulusa mkeka muyatambalale munhu ayo yaholole. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Yesu viyakone kutamanila kwao, kamulongela munhu ayo yaholole, “Mwanangu, nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wakalile hanhu aho wagesa mna imizoyo yao, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“Munhu ino kodahaze kulonga vino? Ino komkudula Imulungu! Imulungu yaiyeka ayo yodaha kuzigela kumgongo nzambi!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Bahaja Yesu kakijuwa kiwagesile mna imizoyo yao. Avo kawauza, “Habali mogesa avo? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Vino choni kibuhile, kumulongela munhu yaholole, ‘Nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo’, hebu kulonga, ‘Ima, papa mkeka wako utembele?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Lakini nolonda mujuwe, Mwana wa Munhu kana udahi mwiisi wa kuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu.” Avo kamulongela munhu ayo yaholole, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>“Nokulongela, lamuka, papa mkeka wako, uchole ukae!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Nayo kenuka, kapapa mkeka wake, kalawa kunze na kasegela mgameso gao. Wose wakanganya, wamtogola Imulungu na walonga, “Hatunachona kinhu kamba kino!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yesu kabweleganya kabili kumgwazo wa lamba da Galilaya. Lunhu lwa wanhu lumcholela, nayo kasonga kuwafundiza. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Viyakalile kobita, kamvika mbokela kodi imoja twaga jake Lawi, mwanage Alufayo kakala mng'anda ya kulihila kodi. Yesu kamulongela, “Nikweleleze.” Lawi kenuka, kamkweleleza.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Yesu viyakalile koja mng'anda ya Lawi, wabokela kodi wengi na wanhu wene nzambi, wakala hamoja nayo woja na wanahina zake, kwavija wanhu wengi wakala omkweleleza. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wakalile Mafalisayo viwamonile Yesu koja na wanhu wene nzambi na wabokela kodi, wawauza wanahina zake, “Habali koja na wanhu kamba wano?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Yesu viyahulike avo kawedika, “Wanhu wagima hawamulonda mganga, ila wanhu watamu omulonda. Sizile kuwakema wanhu ogesa wanoga, niza kuwakema wanhu wene nzambi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kufunga kuja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Wanahina wa Yohana Mbatizaji na wanahina wa Mafalisayo wakala ofunga kuja. Wanhu wayagwe wamcholela Yesu, wamuuza, “Habali wanahina wa Yohana na wanahina wa Mafalisayo ofunga kuja lakini wanahina zako hawafunga kuja?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino yodahika vilihi wanhu wagonekigwe kuna dizengele wafunge kuja kipindi munhu yosola kahamoja nao? Bule! Hawadaha kufunga kuja. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Lakini kipindi chokwiza munhu yosola vonda yasegesigwe kumwao, baho ofunga kuja.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>“Kuduhu munhu yokwika kilaka cha kiwalo cha sambi mna kiwalo cha umwaka. Yahatenda avo, kilaka cha sambi chokidega kiwalo cha umwaka, na aho hadegeke hokongezeka. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Vivija kuduhu munhu yogida divai ya sambi mna imifuko ya ng'hwembe ya umwaka, kwavija yahatenda avo divai ya sambi yoitula imifuko na divai yokwitika na imifuko yobanangika. Ila divai ya sambi yogidigwa mna imifuko ya ng'hwembe ya sambi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya siku ya Kubwihila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Siku dimoja da Kubwihila, Yesu na wanahina zake wakala obita mna imigunda ya uhemba. Viwakalile obita, wanahina zake wasonga kufigisa uhemba. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Mafalisayo wamulongela Yesu, “Lola, wanahina zako otenda kinhu kigomesigwe kutendigwa kudisiku da Kubwihila!”<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Yesu kawedika, “Hamusomile kija kiyatendile Daudi kipindi heyo na wayage viwakalile na nzala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Mna ikipindi cha Mkulu wa walava nhosa Abiatali, Daudi kengila mna Ing'anda ya Imulungu na kugaja magate galavigwe nhosa kwa Imulungu. Magate gago golondigwa kudigwa na walava nhosa waiyeka, lakini Daudi kagaja na abaho kawagwaa wayage.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela, “Siku ya Kubwihila ikigwa mbuli ya wanhu, na siyo wanhu mbuli ya siku ya Kubwihila. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Avo Mwana wa Munhu ayo Mndewa wa siku ya Kubwihila.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Munhu yeli na mkono uholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Abaho Yesu kachola kabili mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu. Ako kukala na munhu yakalile na mkono uholole. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Wanhu wayagwe wakalile aho walonda kilamuso cha kumtagusila Yesu, avo wamulola bunhuu kamba komuhonya munhu ayo mna isiku ya Kubwihila. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Yesu kamulongela munhu ayo yaholole mkono, “Ima hano kuulongozi.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Abaho Yesu kawauza wanhu awo, “Vino Malagizo getu gotulonda tutende choni mna isiku ya Kubwihila? Kutenda ganogile hebu kutenda gehile? Kuuhonya ugima wa munhu hebu kuukoma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Lakini wao wanyamala tuulu. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Yesu kawalola wanhu awo kwa kugevuzika, kawonela bazi mbuli ya udala wa mizoyo yao. Abaho kamulongela munhu ayo, “Golosa mkono wako.” Nayo kaugolosa mkono wake, na mkono wake uhona. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Abaho Mafalisayo walawa kunze mna ing'anda ya kumpula Imulungu, waiting'hana na wanhu wa Helode, wakala kiseto wamkome Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lunhu lomkweleleza Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wachola kudilamba da Galilaya, lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu lumkweleleza. Walawa kuziisi za Galilaya na Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>na buga da Yelusalemu, na isi ya Idumeya, na umwambu wa Yolidani, na kulawa mzimbaka zili mmabehi na mabuga ga Tilo na Sidoni. Wanhu wose awo wamcholela Yesu kwavija wahulika mbuli zake ziyakalile kotenda. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Kwavija lunhu lukala lukulu, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake wamtandile ngalawa ili wanhu sikuwamsung'he sung'he. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Kwavija Yesu kawahonya wanhu wengi, avo wanhu wose wakalile watamu wakala oisung'ha sung'ha wadahe kumkwasa. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Wanhu wakalile na vinyamkela viwamonile Yesu, wamgwila kuulongozi waguta mizangi olonga, “Gweye kwa Mwana wa Imulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Lakini Yesu kawagomesa vinyamkela sikuwamulongele munhu yoyose kamba heyo kakala nani.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosagula watumigwa longo na wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Abaho Yesu kakwela kukigongo, kawakema wanhu yawalondile mwenyego, nao wamgendela. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Kawasagula wanhu longo na wabili, kawakema watumigwa. Kawalongela, “Niwasagula mweye mukale na niye. Vivija nowagala mkawapetele wanhu Mbuli Inogile, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>na mweye mokuwa na udahi wa kulava vinyamkela.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Wano awo longo na wabili iyawasagule, wakala Simoni, Yesu kamgwaa twaga da Petulo <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>na Yakobo na ndugu yake Yohana, wanage Zebedayo kawagwaa twaga da Boanilige, fambulo jake, “Wana wa Ng'huwa” <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>na Andeleya na Filipo na Batulumayo na Matayo na Tomaso na Yakobo mwana wa Alufayo na Tadayo na Simoni Mkananayo, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>na Yuda Isikaliote, yamuhinduke Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Abaho Yesu kachola ukae. Lunhu lwa wanhu luiting'hana kabili mbaka Yesu na wanahina zake walemelwa kuja. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Ndugu zake viwahulike avo, wagenda kumsola kwavija wanhu wakala olonga, “Kana kibozi mbwelela!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe walawile Yelusalemu wakala olonga, “Kana Belizebuli! Ayo mkulu wa vinyamkela yomgwaa udahi wa kuwalava vinyamkela.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Yesu kawakema na kawalongela kwa simo, “Vino Mwenembago kodahaze kumulava Mwenembago? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Kamba undewa wahaigola wenyego na kuitowa, undewa awo ogwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Wanhu wa lubuga lumoja wahaigola na kuitowa, lubuga lulo lofa. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Avo kamba undewa wa Mwenembago wahaigola wenyego, undewa awo ogwa na kuhelela baho.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>“Kuduhu munhu yodaha kutula ng'anda ya munhu mwene nguvu na kusola vinhu vake, mbaka yasonge kumgodeka munhu ayo, baho kodaha kusola vinhu vake.<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>“Nowalongela ukweli, nzambi zose ziwatendile wanhu na maligo gao gose, Imulungu kodaha kugela kumgongo. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Lakini munhu yoyose yomuliga Loho Yang'alile, maligo gake hondagageligwe kumgongo bule, kwavija katenda nzambi ya milele.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Yesu kalonga avo kwavija wanhu wakala olonga, “Kana kinyamkela.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mamake na ndugu zake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Abaho mamake na ndugu zake Yesu weza, wema kunze wamtuma munhu yamkeme Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu lukala lumzunguluke Yesu. Nao wamulongela, “Go mkulu, mamako na ndugu zako wa kunze, okulonda gweye.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mamangu ayo nani? Na ndugu zangu wao nani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Baho kawalola wanhu awo wamzunguluke, kawalongela, “Loleni! Wano awo mamangu na ndugu zangu! <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Munhu yoyose yotenda gaja golondigwa na Imulungu, ayo ndugu yangu na lumbu jangu na mamangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa munhu yohanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Yesu kasonga kufundiza kabili kumgwazo wa lamba da Galilaya. Lunhu lwa wanhu lumzunguluka mbaka kengila mwiingalawa na kukala mumo. Wanhu wose wakala kumgwazo wa lamba. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Kawafundiza vinhu vingi kwa simo, kawalongela,<verse eid="MRK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Tegelezeni! Kukala na munhu kachola kuhanda mbeyu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Viyakalile komiza zimbeyu kumgunda, ziyagwe zilagalila mnzila, ndege weza na kuzija. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Ziyagwe zilagalila mgamabwe hakalile na udongo mdodo. Zota himahima kwavija udongo ukala mdodo. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Zuwa vidilawile, diisoma mimeya na kwavija mizizi yake haicholile hasi ng'hani, inyala. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mvisolo va miba, visolo avo vikula na kuizonga mimeya, nayo ilemelwa kulela. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Lakini mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila hanhu heli na udongo unogile. Zota, zikula na kulela kubanza zija zihandigwe, ziyagwe zilela malongo madatu, ziyagwe zilela malongo sita, na ziyagwe zilela gana dimoja.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Abaho Yesu kalonga, “Munhu yeli na magwiti, yahulike!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilamuso cha kulonga kwa simo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Yesu viyakalile yaiyeka, wanahina zake longo na wabili na wanhu wayagwe wamulongela yawafambulile simo azo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye mugweleligwa kuzijuwa mbuli zifisigwe za Undewa wa Imulungu, lakini awo weli kunze ohulika mbuli zose kwa simo, <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>ili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Walole, lakini sikuwone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">wategeleze lakini sikuwajuwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Kwavija wahavijuwa, odaha kumbwelela Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">na Imulungu kozigela kumgongo nzambi zao.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofambula lusimo lwa munhu yohanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Abaho Yesu kawauza, “Hamulujuwile vilihi lusimo luno? Vino lelo molujuwaze lusimo lolose luyagwe? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Muhandaji kohanda mbuli ya Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Wanhu wayagwe waigala na izimbeyu zilagalile mnzila, wahahulika mbuli, Mwenembago kokwiza na kuisola mbuli ihandigwe mgati mmwao. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Wanhu wayagwe waigala na mbeyu zilagalile mna gamabwe. Wahahulika mbuli, bahaja ozibokela kwa kudeng'helela, <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>lakini kwavija wabule mizizi mgati mmwao, okala kipindi kidodo. Wahagaya na kudununzika mbuli ya usenga awo, obwela kuchugu. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Wanhu wayagwe waigala na mbeyu zilagalile mna ivisolo va miba. Ohulika mbuli, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>lakini magayo ga ugima uno, kulonda utajili, na kulonda mbuli nyingi ziyagwe kuizonga mbuli ayo, nayo ilemelwa kulela. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Lakini wanhu wayagwe waigala na mbeyu zilagalile muulongo unogile. Ouhulika usenga, outogola na olela matunda, wayagwe malongo madatu wayagwe malongo sita na wayagwe gana dimoja.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taa igubikigwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Vino munhu kodaha kubwinha taa mng'anda na kuigubika na kikalango hebu kuika muuvungu wa lusazi? Vino haika kukingolobweda? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Kwavija kinhu chochose kifisigwe chokoneka na kinhu chochose kigubikigwe chogubuligwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Yeli na magwiti yahulike!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Vivija kawalongela, “Iteganyeni na gaja gomuhulika! Vija vimuwatagusa wayagwe na Imulungu kowatagusa vivo na mokongezeligwa ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Waja weli na vinhu okongezelwa, lakini waja welibule vinhu obokigwa hata vija vidodo viwelinavo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mbeyu ikula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Undewa wa Imulungu uigala na kija kilawilile kwa munhu yamizile mbeyu mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Ikilo kowasa, imisi kolamuka, mbeyu zota na kukula, lakini heyo hajuwa choni kigendelela. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Udongo wenyego ozitenda mbeyu zikule goya na kulela matunda, tanhu majani, abaho mada, na omambukiza kwa kuzamiza. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Uhemba wahakangala, munhu ayo kosola sengo na kosonga kusenga kwavija kipindi cha kusenga kivika.”<figure style="fig" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" ref="4:29">Munhu kosenga kwa sengo</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mbeyu ndodo ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Yesu kalonga kabili, “Vino Undewa wa Imulungu uigala na choni? Vino tuusimulile kwa lusimo gani? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Uigala na kija kilawilile kwa munhu yasolile mbeyu ya haladali mbeyu ndodo kubanza zose na kuihanda mumgunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Lakini yahahandigwa, yokula na dokuwa biki kulu kubanza mibiki yose ihandigwe mumgunda. Yokwika matambi makulu ng'hani mbaka ndege ozenga mvulu zao mna gamatambi gake.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Yesu kawapetela wanhu usenga wake kwa simo nyingi ziigalile na zino, kawalongela mbuli nyingi kamba viwadahile kuzijuwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Halongile nao kinhu chochose bila simo, lakini viwakalile waiyeka na wanahina zake, kawafambulila vinhu vose.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohoza beho kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Ichungulo ya siku dijo, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Tuloke umwambu wa lamba.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Avo wawaleka wanhu wose, wanahina zake wengila mwiingalawa yaakalile Yesu na wachola nayo. Vivija kukala na ngalawa ziyagwe hanhu aho. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Bahaja dilawilila nyukwanyukwa kulu da beho na ng'humbi mgamazi gaizola ija ingalawa mbaka ilonda kumema mazi.<figure style="fig" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" ref="4:37">Ngalawa yozoligwa na ng'humbi</figure> <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Yesu kakala kuchugu mwiingalawa, kawasa na keka pala jake muna umto. Wanahina zake wamulamusa na kumulongela, “Mfundiza! Vino gweye hutonga, siye tofa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Yesu kalamuka, kadikomhokela dija dibeho, “Nyamala!” Baho beho dinyamala tuluu, na kukala poozi. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Habali modumba? Mung'hali mwabule kutamanila?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Wanahina zake wadumba na waiuza wenyego, “Vino ino munhu gani? Mbaka beho na ng'humbi vose vomuhulika!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yeli na vinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Yesu na wanahina zake waloka mbaka mwambu wa lamba da Galilaya, mwiisi ya Wagelasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Baho Yesu viyalawile mwiingalawa, kaiting'hana na munhu yeli na vinyamkela. Munhu ayo kalawa kuna gamapanga. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Munhu ayo kakala yokala kuna gamapanga gago, kuduhu munhu yadahile kumgodeka minyololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Miyanza mingi wageza kumgodeka minyololo mmakono na mmagulu, lakini kakala yozikanha na kuzibena bena mhingu zili mmagulu gake. Kakala na nguvu ng'hani na kuduhu munhu yadahile kumgoga. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Imisi na ikilo kakala yokwanga mna gamapanga gaja na kuna ivigongo, kaguta nyangi na kuikanha kanha kwa mabwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Viyamone Yesu kwa kutali, kamkimbilila na kamfugamila. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>Kaguta, “Yesu, Mwana wa Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani! Kolonda choni kumwangu? Iduwile kwa twaga da Imulungu kamba hunidununza bule!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Kalonga avo kwavija Yesu kamulongela, “Kinyamkela, mulawe munhu ino!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Twaga jako nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Munhu ayo kamwidika, “Twaga jangu Lunhu, kwavija twa wengi!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Kampula Yesu sikuyawagale ivinyamkela kunze ya isi ija.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Kukala na bumbila kulu da nguluwe wakala woja kuna umtelemuko wa kigongo. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Avo vinyamkela wampula Yesu, “Tugale kwa nguluwe, na utuleke tuwengile wao.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yesu kawatogolela, avo vinyamkela wamulawa munhu ayo, na wengila mna iwanguluwe. Bumbila jose da nguluwe elufu mbili wahumulukila kudilamba, wose wafila mumo.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Wanhu wakalile owasusila nguluwe awo wakimbila na kuzibwililisa mbuli azo mwiisi na kumigunda. Abaho wanhu wachola kulola kija kilawilile. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Viwavikile kwa Yesu, wamona munhu ayo yakalile na vinyamkela kakala aho na kavala goya viwalo, na nzewele zake zimbwelela na wanhu wose wadumba. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Wanhu wachone acho kilawilile, wawalongela wayao gaja gampatile munhu ayo yakalile na vinyamkela, na mbuli za nguluwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Avo wanhu wampula Yesu yasegele mwiisi yao.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Yesu viyakalile kokwela mwiingalawa, munhu ayo yakalile na vinyamkela kampula Yesu wachole wose.<verse eid="MRK 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Lakini Yesu kamulemela, kamulongela, “Bwela ukae kumwako ukawalongele wanhu wa lukolo lwako gaja gose Mndewa gayakutendele, na viyakonele bazi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Avo munhu ayo kasegela, kachola hanhu hakemigwe Dekapoli, kawalongela wanhu gaja gose Yesu gayamtendele. Wanhu wose wahulike wakanganya.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mndele wa Yailo na mtwanzi yakwasile kiwalo cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Yesu kabwela mwambu uyagwe wa lamba. Lunhu lwa wanhu lumzunguluka kumgwazo wa lamba. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Abaho keza mkulu imoja wa ng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu, twaga jake Yailo. Viyamone Yesu, kaibwanha hasi mmagulu gake, <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>kampula ng'hani, “Mndele wangu kolumwa ng'hani. Nokupula chonde chonde, wize ukamwikile makono ili yahone na yawe mgima.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Abaho Yesu kachola na Yailo, lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu lumkweleleza kuno lomsung'ha sung'ha.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Baho kukala na mtwanzi yakalile na utamu wa kutumika kwa miyaka longo na mibili. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Mtwanzi ayo kachola kwa waganga wengi na katumia vinhu vose viyakalile navo, lakini hahonile bule, ila kagendelela kulumwa ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Viyazihulike mbuli za Yesu, kengila mna ulunhu lwa wanhu, kamcholela Yesu kuchugu na kakwasa kiwalo chake. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Kailongela mwenyego, “Nahakwasa kiwalo chake, nohona.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Viyakwasile kiwalo cha Yesu, bahaja kutumika kuleka, nayo kahulika kahona utamu wake. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Bahaja Yesu kajuwa nguvu zimulawa, avo kahinduka muulunhu na kuuza, “Nani yanikwasile kiwalo changu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Wanahina zake wamwidika, “Kowona wanhu viwokusung'ha sung'ha, abaho kouza nani yakukwasile?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Lakini Yesu kalola mhande zose ili yamone munhu yatendile vivo. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Mtwanzi ayo kajuwa kinhu kimulawilile, avo kamgendela Yesu kuno kodumba na kugwaya. Kamfugamila Yesu, kamulongela fulu ipile. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Yesu kamulongela mtwanzi ayo, “Mwanangu, kutamanila kwako kukuhonya. Genda moyo uholile, kuhona utamu wako.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Yesu viyakalile kogendelela kulonga, wasenga kulawa ukae kumwake Yailo weza na kumulongela Yailo, “Mndele wako kafa. Habali kogendelela kumgaza Mfundiza?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Yesu viyazihulike mbuli azo zilongigwe na wasenga awo, hazigesile bule, lakini kamulongela Yailo, “Sikuudumbe, togola tu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Abaho Yesu halondile munhu yoyose iyagwe yamkweleleze, ila Petulo, Yakobo na Yohana, ndugu yake Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Viwavikile mng'anda ya Yailo, Yesu kawona wanhu obwahanhuka kwa usungu na kuiyalala. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Yesu kengila mng'anda kawalongela, “Habali moiyalala na kulila? Imwana hafile bule, lakini kawasa!”<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Lakini wamseka, avo Yesu kawalava kunze wose, kamsola tatake na mamake ija imwana, na waja wanahina zake wadatu. Wengila mna idigati mulutambalizwe lukuli lwa mwana ayo. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Yesu kamgoga mkono, kamulongela, “Talita Kumi!” fambulo jake, “Mndele, nokulongela lamuka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Bahaja mndele ayo kenuka na kasonga kugenda. Mndele ayo kakala na miyaka longo na mibili. Mbuli ino viilawilile, wanhu wakanganya ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Lakini Yesu kawagomesa ng'hani sikuwamulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ayo ilawilile, abaho kawalongela, “Mgweleleni ndiya mndele ino.”<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemigwa ako Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Yesu kasegela hanhu aho kachola kudibuga diyavumbuke, na wanahina zake wamkweleleza. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Vidivikile siku da Kubwihila, Yesu kasonga kufundiza mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu. Wanhu wamuhulike wakanganya ng'hani, waiuza, “Munhu ino kazipata kwahi mbuli zino? Nzewele gani ino mbaka kodaha kutenda unzonza uno? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Vino ino siyo ija fundi selemala, mwanage Malia, na ndugu zake Yakobo na Yusufu na Yuda na Simoni? Vino lumbu zake hawakala bahano bule?” Avo wamulema.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mtula ndagu kotegelezigwa kila hanhu, lakini hategelezigwa ukae kumwake na kwa ndugu zake, na kwa wanhu wa lukolo lwake mwenyego.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Yesu hatendile unzonza wowose, ila kawekila makono watamu kidogo na kawahonya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Yesu kakanganya ng'hani kwavija wanhu wakala wabule kutamanila.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu kowatuma wanahina longo na wabili</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Abaho Yesu kachola mna ivijiji vili behi, na kasonga kuwafundiza wanhu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Kawakema wanahina longo na wabili, kawatuma wabili wabili, na kawagwaa udahi wa kulava vinyamkela. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Kawalongela, “Sikumusole kinhu chochose, ila mkongoja wiiyeka. Sikumusole gate hebu mkoba hebu sente mkibindo. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Valeni vilatu, lakini sikumusole kiwalo kiyagwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Hanhu hohose honda mubokeligwe, kaleni aho mbaka vonda musegele. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Mwahavika kudibuga jojose na wanhu wa aho wahalema kuwabokela hebu kuwategeleza, segeleni na kung'huseni matimbwisi geli mmagulu genu ili iwe kilaguso kamba wawatendela nzambi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Avo wasegela na kuwapetela wanhu waleke nzambi zao. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Wawalava vinyamkela wengi na kuwabakaza mavuta wanhu wengi wakalile watamu na kuwahonya.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yohana Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Mndewa Helode kahulika mbuli azo zose, kwavija twaga da Yesu dikala dijuwike kila hanhu. Wanhu wayagwe wakala olonga, “Yohana Mbatizaji kazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile, lekaavo kana udahi wa kutenda unzonza.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Ino Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Na wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Ino mtula ndagu kaigala na imoja wa watula ndagu wa Imulungu wa kuko umwaka.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Helode viyazihulike mbuli azo, kalonga, “Ino ayo Yohana Mbatizaji inimkanhile pala jake lakini kazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Helode mwenyego kakala yalagize Yohana yagodekigwe nzabi, abaho yekigwe mkifungo. Katenda avo mbuli ya Helodiya iyamsolile, hamoja kakala mwehe wa Filipo, mdodo wake. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Yohana Mbatizaji kakala yomulongela Helode, “Malagizo golonga, havinogile bule gweye umsole mwehe wa mdodo wako!”<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Avo Helodiya kakala komwihila Yohana, na kalonda kumkoma. Lakini hadahile bule, <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>kwavija Helode kakala komdumba Yohana na kajuwa kamba kakala munhu yanogile na yang'alile avo kamkaliza. Kakala konogelwa kumuhulika, hamoja moyo umuluma ng'hani kila viyamalile kumuhulika.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Siku dimoja, Helodiya kapata nyafasi mna idisiku da kukumbuka kuvumbuka kwa Helode. Helode kawatendela nyimwilinyimwili ng'hulu wakulu wa mabuga, na wakulu wa wakalizi, na vilongozi wa isi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Mndele wa Helodiya viyengile kucheza, kamnogeza ng'hani Helode na wageni wagonekigwe kuna inyimwilinyimwili. Avo mndewa Helode kamulongela mndele ayo, “Nipule chochose kiulonda, nokugwaa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Kaiduwila, “Noiduwila, nokugwaa chochose chonda unipule, hata nusu ya undewa wangu nokugwaa!”<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Avo mndele ayo kalawa kunze kamuuza mamake, “Nipule choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Nayo kamwidika, “Pula pala da Yohana Mbatizaji.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Bahaja mndele ayo kakimbila mbaka kwa mndewa, kamulongela, “Sambi baha nigwelele pala da Yohana Mbatizaji mditanda!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Mndewa kona usungu ng'hani, lakini kwavija kaiduwila mgameso ga wanhu wagonekigwe, hadahile kumulemela. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Bahaja mndewa kamulagiza mkalizi yadigale pala da Yohana. Mkalizi kagenda mkifungo, kakanha pala da Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>Abaho kadika pala dija mditanda, kamgalila mndele ayo, nayo kamgwaa mamake. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Wanahina wa Yohana viwahulike mbuli ayo, wachola kulusola lukuli lwa Yohana na kuluzika.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowagwaa ndiya lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Watumigwa wabwela, waiting'hana na Yesu na wamulongela gaja gose gawatendile na kufundiza. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Baho kukala na wanhu wengi wakalile okwiza na kusegela, mbaka Yesu na wanahina zake hawapatile nyafasi ya kuja kinhu. Avo Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Tucholeni twiiyeka hanhu kuduhu wanhu mkabwihile kidogo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Avo wasegela waiyeka mwiingalawa, wachola hanhu kuduhu wanhu. <verse eid="MRK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Wanhu viwonile osegela, bahaja wawajuwa. Avo walawa mna gamabuga gose, wakimbila mbaka wawalongolela kuvika Yesu na wanahina zake. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Yesu viyahumuluke mwiingalawa, kaluvika lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu. Kawonela bazi kwavija wakala kamba ng'hondolo welibule msusilaji. Avo kasonga kuwafundiza vinhu vingi.<verse eid="MRK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Zuwa vidikalile dohonga, wanahina zake wamcholela Yesu, wamulongela, “Hanhu hano hatwili kuduhu wanhu, na sambi zuwa dohonga. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Walongele wanhu wachole mna imigunda na vijiji vilibehi ili wakaigulile vinhu va kuja.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Yesu kawedika, “Wagweleleni mweye kinhu chakuja waje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Wamuuza, “Vino tuchole tukagule magate ga sente ifa ya kumuliha msang'hanaji kwa miyezi minane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37</char><char style="fk">Sente za miyezi minane,</char> hebu sente magana mabili.</note> tuwagwee waje?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Yesu kawauza, “Munago magate mangapi? Gendeni mukalole.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Viwagalolile, wamulongela, “Kuna magate matano na somba wabili.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake wawagole wanhu wose mna ivibumbila bumbila, wakale hasi mna gamajani mabisi. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Avo wakala mna ivibumbila va wanhu gana na va wanhu malongo matano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Abaho Yesu kasola gaja gamagate matano na somba wabili, kalola uchanha na kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu. Abaho kagabanzula gaja gamagate, kawagwaa wanahina zake wawagolele wanhu. Vivija kawagolela wose somba waja wabili. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Wanhu wose waja na kwiguta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Abaho wanahina zake wadondola magate gasigale na iwasomba, wamemeza vigelo longo na vibili. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Wambigalo waiyeka wadile wakala kamba elufu tano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotembela uchanha mgamazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Bahaja Yesu kawalagiza wanahina zake wakwele mwiingalawa wamulongolele kuchola Betisaida, kuna umwambu uyagwe wa lamba. Heyo kakala yolulaga lunhu lwa wanhu lusegele. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Viyamambukize kuwalaga wanhu, kakwela kuna ikigongo kumpula Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Viivikile ichungulo, ngalawa ikala hagati ya lamba, lakini Yesu kakala yaiyeka mwiisi inyalile. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Yesu kawona wanahina zake olemelwa kutowa ng'hafi, kwavija beho kulu dikala dowabweza kuwalawile. Nzogolo zikwika, Yesu kawagendela, kuno kotembela uchanha mgamazi. Kalonda kuwabita, <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>lakini viwamone kotembela uchanha mgamazi, wagizaga mzimu. Wakemelela kwa bwembwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Wose viwamone wadumba ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Bahaja Yesu kawalongela, “Gangamaleni! Iyo nene! Sikumudumbe!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Abaho Yesu kengila mwiingalawa, na beho dinyamala tuluu. Wanahina zake wakanganya ng'hani, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>kwavija wakala hawajuwile fambulo da kuwagwaa ndiya wanhu elufu tano, mizoyo yao ikala midala.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya watamu ako Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayo 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Waloka umwambu, wavika kuna iisi ya Genesaleti, baho waifunga ngalawa yao. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Bahaja viwahumuluke mwiingalawa, wanhu wamjuwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Avo wakimbila mwiisi yose, na kila hanhu viwahulike Yesu kabaho wamgalila watamu watambalale mvisazi vao. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Kila hanhu Yesu hayacholile, iwe mna ivijiji, hebu mna gamabuga, hebu mna imigunda, wanhu wawasola watamu zao na kuwagala kuna gamagulilo. Wampula Yesu yawatogolele waikwase mhindo ya kiwalo chake. Wose waikwasile wahona.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mafundizo ga wahenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matayo 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wezile kulawa Yelusalemu waiting'hana haulongozi wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Wawona wanahina wayagwe wa Yesu oja bila kusunha makono gao kamba viilondigwa wanhu watende.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Mafalisayo na Wayahudi wayagwe okweleleza mafundizo gawabokele kwa wahenga zao, hawaja kinhu mbaka wasunhe makono gao ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Wala hawaja kinhu chochose kulawa kudigulilo mbaka wasunhe, na okweleleza mafundizo gayagwe mengi kamba vija mwiko wa kusunha vikasi na nongo na viya va shaba na gayagwe mengi.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Avo Mafalisayo na Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wamuuza Yesu, “Habali wanahina zako hawakweleleza mafundizo gatugoleligwe na wahenga zetu, lakini oja bila kusunha makono?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mwa watapitapi! Kumbe mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Isaya kalagula goya mbuli zenu viyandike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Imulungu kolonga, wanhu wano, onitegeleza kwa milomo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">lakini mizoyo yao ya kutali ng'hani na niye.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Awo onitambikila bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">kwavija ofundiza mafundizo ga wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">na kugatenda kamba galawa kwa Imulungu!’<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>“Mweye mogaleka Malagizo ga Imulungu na mogagoga mafundizo ga wanhu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Mweye mwa wabala kwa kulema Malagizo ga Imulungu na kugagoga mafundizo genu wenyego. <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Kwavija Musa kawalagiza, ‘Mtegeleze tatako na mamako,’ ‘Munhu yoyose yonda yamulige tatake hebu mamake kolondigwa yakomigwe.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Lakini mweye mofundiza, kamba munhu kana kinhu kodaha kumtaza tatake hebu mamake lakini kolonga ‘Ino kobani’ fambulo jake kinhu kino nimulavila Imulungu, <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>munhu ayo halondigwa kumtaza tatake hebu mamake. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Kwa nzila ino mafundizo genu gomuwagwaa wanhu gosegesa mbuli za Imulungu. Na gayagwe mengi kamba gano gomutenda.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vinhu vimfitiza munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matayo 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Abaho Yesu kalukema lunhu lwa wanhu kabili na kalulongela, “Mweye mose mnitegeleze na mujuwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Kuduhu kinhu kingila mmulomo wa munhu kulawa kunze kidaha kumfitiza munhu. Lakini, kija kilawa mmulomo wa munhu acho kimfitiza munhu.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>Munhu yeli na magwiti yahulike.<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Yesu na wanahina zake, viwalulekile lunhu lwa wanhu na kwingila mng'anda, wanahina zake wamuuza yawalongele fambulo da ulonzi uja. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Vino mweye mwabule nzewele kubanza wanhu wayagwe? Vino hamujuwile kamba kuduhu kinhu kingila mmulomo wa munhu kulawa kunze kidaha kumfitiza munhu? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Kwavija hakingila muumoyo lakini mna iinda na abaho cholawa kunze ya lukuli.” Kwa ulonzi uno Yesu kavitenda vinhu vose va kuja vinoge kudigwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Kagendelela kulonga, “Kinhu kilawa muumoyo wa munhu acho kimfitiza munhu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Kwavija muumoyo wa munhu golawa magesa gehile na kuiwasa chaka chaka na ubavi na ukomaji, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>na ugoni na umelo na gehile na uvizi na kusulukila na migongo na maligo na kuitapa na ubozi. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Ago gose gehile golawa mgati mwa munhu na kumfitiza munhu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutamanila kwa mtwanzi imoja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayo 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Abaho Yesu kahalawa hanhu aho kachola mwiimbaka ili behi na buga da Tilo. Kengila mng'anda na halondile munhu yoyose yajuwe kakala aho, lakini hadahile bule kuifisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Mtwanzi imoja, yakalile na mndele wake yeli na kinyamkela, viyahulike mbuli za Yesu, bahaja kamgendela na kamfugamila Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Mtwanzi ayo hakalile Muyahudi, kavumbuka kudibuga da Silofoinike mwiisi ya Siliya kampula Yesu yamulave mndele wake kinyamkela. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Lakini Yesu kamwidika, “Tanhu waleke wana wegute. Kwavija havinogile bule kusola ndiya ya iwana na kuwapigisila umbwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Mtwanzi ayo kamwidika, “Ona, go mkulu, lakini hata umbwa weli hasi mmeza oja kija kisigazigwe na iwana!”<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Yesu kamulongela mtwanzi ayo, “Kwavija kwidika vivo, bwela ukae kumwako na komvika mndele wako kinyamkela kamulawa!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Mtwanzi ayo kachola ukae kumwake, viyavikile kamvika mndele wake katambalala mulusazi na kinyamkela kakala yamulawile.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu hadahile kulonga na kuhulika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Yesu kasegela kachola behi na isi ya Tilo kwa kubitila mwiisi ya Sidoni mbaka kudilamba da Galilaya kwa kubitila nzila ya mna zimbaka za Dekapoli. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamgalila munhu yakalile hahulika na halonga, wampula Yesu yamwikile makono. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Yesu kamsola kamgala hamgwazo hanhu kuduhu wanhu. Yesu kengiza vidole mna gamagwitwi ga munhu ayo, katema mate kamkwasa lulimi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Abaho Yesu kalola kuulanga, kabweza mhumuzi, kamulongela, “Efata!” fambulo jake, “Vuguka!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Bahaja munhu ayo magwiti gake gavuguka na kakala yohulika na kulonga bila kugaya. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Abaho Yesu kawagomesa wanhu awo sikuwamulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ayo, lakini Yesu viyagendelele kuwagomesa, vivo viwagendelele kuibwililisa mbuli ayo. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Wanhu wose waihulike mbuli ayo wakanganya. Walonga, “Katenda goya kila kinhu, kowatenda wanhu hawahulika wahulike na wanhu hawalonga walonge!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowagwaa ndiya wanhu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayo 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Hazibitile siku nyingi lunhu luyagwe lukulu lwa wanhu luiting'hana. Wanhu viwakalile wabule kinhu chochose chakuja Yesu kawakema wanahina zake kawalongela, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“Niye nowonela bazi wanhu wano, kwavija wakala na niye kwa siku ndatu na wabule kinhu chakuja. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Nahawalongela wabwele ukayao na nzala, osinduka mnzila, kwavija wanhu wayagwe walawa kutali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Wanahina zake wamuuza, “Hano hatwili twa kuluwala, toipata kwahi ndiya ya kuwagwaa wanhu wose wano?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Yesu kawauza, “Mna magate mangapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Wamwidika, “Tuna magate saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Yesu kalulongela lunhu luja lwa wanhu lukale hasi. Abaho kasola gamagate saba, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kagabanzula kawagwaa wanahina zake wawagolele wanhu, na wanahina zake watenda vivo. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Vivija wakala na visomba kidogo. Yesu kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, vivija kawalongela wanahina zake wawagolele wanhu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Wanhu waja na kwiguta. Abaho wanahina zake wadondola vija visigale na kumemeza vigelo saba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Wambigalo waiyeka wadile wakala elufu nne. Abaho Yesu kawalaga, <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>bahaja Yesu na wanahina zake wakwela mwiingalawa, wachola mwiisi ya Dalimanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo olonda vilaguso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wamcholela Yesu wasonga kuibamilila nayo, walonda kumgeza wampula yatende kilaguso kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Lakini Yesu kona usungu, kalonga, “Habali wanhu wa lukolo luno lwa sambi molonda vilaguso? Nowalongeleni ukweli, kuduhu kilaguso chonda mugoleligwe!”<verse eid="MRK 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Yesu kawaleka, kakwela mwiingalawa kaloka mwambu uyagwe wa dilamba.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usasu wa Mafalisayo na Helode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayo 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Wanahina zake wakala waisemwile kusola magate, wakala na gate dimoja diiyeka mwiingalawa. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Yesu kawazuma wanahina zake kawalongela, “Muiteganye na hamila ya Mafalisayo na hamila ya Helode.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Wanahina zake wasonga kuinyong'onyela, “Ino kolonga vino kwavija twabule magate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Yesu kakijuwa kiwakalile olonga, kawauza, “Habali moilongela mbuli ya magate? Vino mung'hali hamujuwile? Habali mizoyo yenu midala? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Muna meso lakini hamulola, muna magwiti lakini hamuhulika? Vino hamukumbuka bule? <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Vinibanzule magate matano na kuwagwaa wanhu elufu tano? Vino mmemeza vigelo vingapi kwa avo visigale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Wamwidika, “Tumemeza vigelo longo na vibili.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>Kawauza kabili, “Vivija vinibanzule gaja magate saba na kuwagwaa wanhu elufu nne, vino mmemeza vigelo vingapi kwa avo visigale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Wamwidika, “Tumemeza vigelo saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Abaho kawauza, “Mung'hali hamnavijuwa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya msuwameso ako Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwavikile Betisaida, wanhu wayagwe wamgalila Yesu munhu yakalile msuwameso, wampula yamkwase. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Yesu kamgoga mkono munhu ayo, kamulava kunze ya kijiji kija. Abaho kamtemela mate mgameso, kamwikila makono, kamuuza, “Vino kokona choni?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Munhu ija kalola, kalonga, “Nowona wanhu, lakini waigala na mibiki itembela.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Yesu kamwikila makono kabili mgameso. Munhu ayo kabunhula meso na meso gake galola, nayo kadaha kulola goya vinhu vose. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Yesu kamulongela munhu ayo yachole ukae kumwake, kamzuma, “Sikuyabweleganye mna ikijiji.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kolonga Yesu ayo Mkombola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Abaho Yesu na wanahina zake wachola kuna ivijiji va Kaisalia ya Filipi, mnzila Yesu kawauza wanahina zake, “Nongeleni wanhu olonga niye na nani?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Wamwidika, “Wanhu wayagwe olonga gweye kwa Yohana Mbatizaji, wanhu wayagwe olonga gweye kwa Eliya, kuno wayagwe olonga gweye kwa imoja wa watula ndagu wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Yesu kawauza, “Na mweye molonga niye na nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petulo kamwidika, “Gweye kwa Kilisito Mkombola.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Abaho Yesu kawagomesa wanahina zake, “Sikumumulongele munhu yoyose mbuli zangu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya madununzo na ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matayo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Abaho Yesu kasonga kuwafundiza wanahina zake, “Mwana wa Munhu kolondigwa yadununzigwe ng'hani na kulemigwa na wavele na wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Kokomigwa na siku da kadatu kozilibuka.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Yesu kawalongela fulu ipile, avo Petulo kamgala Yesu kumgwazo kasonga kumkomhokela. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Lakini Yesu kahinduka kawalola wanahina zake, kamkomhokela Petulo, “Segela kumwangu Mwenembago! Kwavija hugesa mbuli za Imulungu lakini kogesa mbuli za kiunhu!”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Abaho Yesu kalukema lunhu lwa wanhu na wanahina zake kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose yahalonda kunikweleleza, yaileme mwenyego na kuidikwa msalaba wake yanikweleleze. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yahalonda kuukombola ugima wake kowagiza, na munhu yoyose yowagiza ugima wake mbuli ya niye na kwa Mbuli Inogile koukombola. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Vino munhu kopata choni kamba yahaipata isi yose na kuwagiza ugima wake? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Kuduhu kinhu chonda yalave yaubweze ugima wake. <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Munhu yoyose yonyonela kinyala niye na mafundizo gangu mna ulukolo lwa sambi lulekile kumjuwa Imulungu na kutenda gehile, Mwana wa Munhu nayo komonela kinyala munhu ayo yaheza muukulu wa Tatake na wasenga zake wang'alile wa kuulanga.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Nowalongela ukweli, wanhu wayagwe weli hano hawafa bule mbaka wawone Undewa wa Imulungu ukwiza na nguvu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaluka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matayo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Vizibitile siku sita, Yesu kamsola Petulo, Yakobo na Yohana, kachola nao waiyeka kulugongo lutali. Viwakalile olola, Yesu kagaluka. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Viwalo vake vikala vizelu chuwee, na kuduhu munhu yoyose mwiisi yodaha kuvifuwa viwe vizelu kamba vivo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Baho wanahina waja wadatu wamona Eliya na Musa olonga na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Petulo kamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, vinoga siye tukale hano! Tozenga viheha vidatu, kimoja chako gweye, kimoja cha Musa na kimoja cha Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Petulo hajuwile cha kulonga kwavija heyo na wayage wakala odumba.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Abaho dilawilila wingu na kuwagubika na sauti ilawa mdiwingu, ilonga, “Ino ayo Mwanangu inimnogele. Mumtegeleze!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Bahaja wawegesela kuno na kuno, lakini hawamonile munhu yoyose iyagwe, ila Yesu yaiyeka hamoja nao.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Viwakalile ohumuluka kulugongo Yesu kawazuma, “Sikumumulongele munhu yoyose mbuli zino zimone, mbaka Mwana wa Munhu vonda yazilibuke kulawa kwa wafile.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Watogola kija kiwalongeligwe, lakini wasonga kuiuza, “Kuzilibuka kwa wafile, fambulo jake choni?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Wanahina zake wamuuza Yesu, “Habali wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa olonga Eliya kolondigwa yeze tanhu?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ona, Eliya kokwiza tanhu, ili yakitande goya kila kinhu. Lakini habali Maandiko Gang'alile golonga kamba Mwana wa Munhu kodununzika ng'hani na kulemigwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Nowalongeleni, Eliya kamala kwiza na wanhu wamtendela viwalondile, kamba vija Maandiko Gang'alile vigalonga.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya mbwanga yeli na kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Viwawavikile waja wanahina wayagwe, waluwona lunhu lwa wanhu luwazunguluka na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wakala oibamilila nao. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Bahaja wanhu viwamone Yesu wakanganya ng'hani, wamkimbilila, wamulamusa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Yesu kawauza wanahina zake, “Mweye moibamilila nao choni?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Munhu imoja mna ulunhu lwa wanhu kamwidika, “Mfundiza, nikugalila mwanangu, kana kinyamkela yamfungile mulomo. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Kinyamkela ayo yahamwizila, komulagaza hasi na kolawa miholovu mmulomo, kodafuna meno na kunyala lukuli lose. Niwalongela wanahina zako wamulave ikinyamkela, lakini hawadahile bule.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye wanhu muleka kutamanila! Ng'hale na mweye mbaka lini? Nogela kitumbe kumgongo mbaka lini? Ngalileni hano imbwanga.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Avo wamgala kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Bahaja kinyamkela viyamone Yesu, kamgela kisango imbwanga ayo, kagwa hasi, kaibimbilisa, kuno kolava mihovu mmulomo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yesu kamuuza tata wa imbwanga ayo, “Utamu uno umsonga lini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Kamwidika, “Umsonga toka haudodo. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Miyanza mingi kinyamkela kamgeza kumkoma kwa kumbwanha muumoto na mgamazi. Tonele bazi na ututaze, kamba wahadaha!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kolonga, kamba wahadaha! Kila kinhu chodahika kwa munhu yotamanila.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Bahaja tata wa imbwanga ija kakemelela, “Notamanila, lakini kutamanila kwangu kudodo. Nhaze nitamanile ng'hani!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yesu viyaluwone lunhu lowamemela, kamkomhokela kinyamkela ayo, “Gweye kinyamkela wa kuleka kulonga na kuhulika, nokulagiza umulawe mbwanga ino, sikuumwingile kabili!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Kinyamkela kaguta, kambwanha hasi mbwanga ayo, kamulawa. Mbwanga ayo koneka kamba munhu yafile, kila munhu kalonga, “Kafa!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Lakini Yesu kamgoga mkono mbwanga ayo kamtaza kwinuka, nayo kenuka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Yesu viyengile mng'anda, wanahina zake wamuuza kinyelegezi, “Habali siye hatudahile kumulava kinyamkela?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Yesu kawedika, “Kinyamkela kamba ino hadahika kulavigwa kwa nzila yoyose, ila kwa kumpula Imulungu kwiiyeka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga kabili mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wasegela hanhu aho wachola kubitila isi ya Galilaya. Yesu halondile munhu yoyose yajuwe kuyeli, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>kwavija kakala kowafundiza wanahina zake. Kawalongela, “Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu, nao omkoma na siku da kadatu kozilibuka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Lakini wanahina zake hawadijuwile fambulo da ulonzi awo na wadumba kumuuza.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeli mkulu nani?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Wavika Kapelinaumu, viwengile mng'anda, Yesu kawauza wanahina zake, “Mukala muibamilila choni mnzila?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Lakini wanahina zake hawamwidike bule, kwavija mnzila wakala oibamilila nani yeli munhu mkulu viweli. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Yesu kakala hasi, kawakema wanahina zake longo na wabili, kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose yolonda kuwa wa ichanduso, kolondigwa yawe wa ikimambukizo na yawe msang'hanaji wa wose.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Abaho Yesu kamsola mwana mdodo kamwimiza haulongozi wao, kamuhagatila kawalongela, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>“Munhu yoyose yombokela mwana mdodo kamba ino kwa twaga jangu, kombokela niye, na munhu yoyose yombokela niye hambokela niye niiyeka vivija kombokela ija yanhumile.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yoyose hatulema kaubanzi wetu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Yohana kamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, tumona munhu imoja kolava vinyamkela kwa twaga jako. Siye tumgomesa kwavija siyo miyetu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Sikumumgomese, kwavija kuduhu munhu yotenda unzonza kwa twaga jangu na kuno kononga vihile. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose hatulema kaubanzi wetu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Nowalongela ukweli munhu yoyose yowagwaa kikasi cha mazi ga kung'wa kwa twaga jangu kwavija mweye mwa wanhu wa Kilisito kobokela nhunza yake.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugezigwa kutenda nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>“Munhu yoyose yomuhonza imoja wa wadodo wano onitogola yatende nzambi, yokuwa vinoga munhu ayo yagodekigwe dibwe kulu da kudugila msingo na yasigwe mbahali. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Kamba mkono wako wahakuhonza utende nzambi, ukanhe! Yokuwa vinoga wingile kuna ugima na mkono umoja, kubanza wingile na makono mabili na abaho uchole jehanamu kuna umoto haufaga. <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>Mumo, ‘Funza owaja hawafa bule na umoto uwalukuza haufaga.’ <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Kamba mgulu wako wahakuhonza utende nzambi, ukanhe! Yokuwa vinoga wingile kuna ugima na mgulu umoja, kubanza wingile na magulu gose mabili na abaho wasigwe jehanamu. <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Mumo, ‘Funza owaja hawafa bule na umoto uwalukuza haufaga.’ <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Kamba siso jako dahakuhonza utende nzambi, ding'ole! Yokuwa vinoga wingile Muundewa wa Imulungu na siso dimoja, kubanza wingile na meso gose mabili na abaho wasigwe jehanamu. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Mumo, ‘Funza owaja hawafa bule na umoto uwalukuza haufaga.’<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>“Kila munhu kotendigwa yatogoligwe na Imulungu kwa moto kamba vija nhosa viitogoligwa na Imulungu kwa mkele.<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>“Mkele unoga, lakini kamba wahagiza ukali wake, vino kodahaze kuubweza kabili?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Muwe na mkele mgati yenu na mukale kwa tindiwalo na waenu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofundiza mbuli ya nyasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Abaho Yesu kasegela kachola isi ya Yudea, kaloka lwanda lwa Yolidani, lunhu lwa wanhu lumcholela Yesu kabili, nayo kawafundiza kamba viyatendaga.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wamcholela Yesu wamgeza, wamuuza, “Tulongele, vino vinoga mbigalo kumwasa mwehe wake?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Yesu kawauza, “Vino Musa kawalagiza choni?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Wamwidika, “Musa katulagiza kamba mbigalo kodaha kumgwaa kibua cha nyasa mwehe wake na kumwasa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Musa kawandikila lagizo dino mbuli ya udala wa mizoyo yenu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Maandiko Gang'alile golonga kulawa kuna ichanduso, ‘Imulungu kawalumba mbigalo na mtwanzi. <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>Kwa mbuli ayo mbigalo komuleka tatake na mamake na koilumba na mwehe wake, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>na wabili awo okuwa kinhu kimoja.’ Avo haweli wabili kabili, lakini kinhu kimoja. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Avo kiyalumbilize Imulungu, munhu sikuyakigole.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Viwabwelile mng'anda, wanahina zake wamuuza Yesu mbuli ino. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mbigalo yomwasa mwehe wake na kumsola mtwanzi iyagwe, komtendela ugoni mwehe wake. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Vivija mtwanzi yomulema mkasano wake na kusoligwa na mbigalo iyagwe kotenda ugoni.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatambikila wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamgalila Yesu wana wadodo yawahagatile na kuwatambikila, lakini wanahina zake wawakomhokela. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Yesu viyonile avo, kagevuzika, kawalongela, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kumwangu sikumuwagomese kwavija Undewa wa Imulungu ni wa wanhu kamba wana wano. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, munhu yoyose yolema kuubokela Undewa wa Imulungu kamba mwana mdodo, honda yengile ng'o.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Abaho kawahagatila wana waja kawekila makono gake kawatambikila.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu tajili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Yesu viyasongile mwanza wake kabili, munhu imoja kamkimbilila, kamfugamila kamuuza, “Mfundiza Unogile, nhende choni niupate ugima wa milele?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Habali kong'hema unogile? Kuduhu yanogile, ila Imulungu yaiyeka. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Kugajuwa Malagizo ga Musa, ‘Sikuukome, sikuutende ugoni, sikuwibe, sikuulave usindila wa uvizi, sikuulonge uvizi, wategeleze tatako na mamako.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Munhu ayo kamwidika, “Mfundiza gano gose nigagoga toka haudodo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yesu kamulola bunhuu, kamnogela, kamulongela, “Kuhungukilwa kinhu kimoja. Genda kachuuze vinhu vose viulinavo na uwagwelele wakiwa zisente na gweye kokuwa na utajili kuulanga. Abaho unikweleleze.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Munhu ija viyahulike avo, kona usungu, kasegela kuno kanyunyuwala kwavija kakala tajili ng'hani.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Yesu kalola mhande zose kawalongela wanahina zake, “Yokuwa vidala ng'hani kwa munhu tajili kwingila Muundewa wa Imulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Ulonzi uno uwasinhusa wanahina zake, lakini Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Wanangu, vidala ng'hani kwingila Muundewa wa Imulungu! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Vibuha kwa ngamiya kubita mna ikizonzo cha sanzia kubanza tajili kwingila Muundewa wa Imulungu.”<figure style="fig" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" ref="10:25">Ngamiya</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Wanahina wakanganya ng'hani waiuza, “Avo lelo nani yonda yadahe kukomboligwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yesu kawalola bunhuu, kawalongela, “Kwa munhu haidahika lakini kwa Imulungu haili vivo, gose godahika kwa Imulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Lola, siye tuleka kila kinhu na tukukweleleza gweye.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela kweli, munhu yoyose yalekile ng'anda yake hebu ndugu zake hebu lumbu zake hebu mamake hebu tatake hebu wanage hebu migunda mbuli ya niye na kwa Mbuli Inogile, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>kobokela vingi ng'hani mna ikipindi cha sambi. Na kobokela ng'hani miyanza gana, ng'anda na ndugu na lumbu na wana na mama na migunda na hamoja na madununzo na mna ikipindi chonda kize kobokela ugima wa milele. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Lakini wanhu wengi weli wa ichanduso okuwa wa ikimambukizo na waja wa ikimambukizo okuwa wa ichanduso.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mwanza wa kadatu mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wakala mnzila ochola Yelusalemu. Yesu kawalongolela wanahina zake wakalile okanganya kuno wanhu wakalile omkweleleza wadumba. Yesu kainega hamgwazo na wanahina zake longo na wabili, kawalongela gaja gonda gamulawilile. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Tegelezeni, tochola Yelusalemu, kuko Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Omtagusa yafe na kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu haweli Wayahudi, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>nao omzeha na omtemela mate na omtowa mbalati na omkoma lakini siku da kadatu kozilibuka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupula kwa Yakobo na Yohana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayo 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Abaho Yakobo na Yohana, wana wa Zebedayo wamcholela Yesu, wamulongela, “Mfundiza, kuna kinhu tolonda ututendele.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Yesu kawauza, “Molonda niwatendele choni?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Wamwidika, “Vondaukale kuna ikigoda chako cha Undewa wako, tolonda ukale na siye, imoja mwambu wa mkono wako wa kudila na iyagwe mwambu wa mkono wako wa kumoso.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Hamkijuwile kinhu kimpula. Vino modaha kuking'wela kikasi cha madununzo chonda niking'wele niye? Na kubatizigwa ubatizo unibatizigwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Wamwidika, “Todaha,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yesu kawalongela, “Mong'wela kikasi chonda ning'wele niye na kubatizigwa ubatizo onda nibatizigwe niye. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Lakini niye nabule udahi wa kusagula nani yakale mwambu wa mkono wangu wa kudila hebu wa kumoso. Imulungu ayo yonda yawagwee hanhu aho, wanhu waja yawasagule.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Baho wanahina longo viwahulike vivo wawagevuzikila ng'hani Yakobo na Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Yesu kawakema wose hamoja kawalongela, “Mojuwa kamba waja okoneka wakulu wa isi, owalanguliza wanhu kwa nguvu, na wakulu wao wana udahi. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Lakini haili vivo kumwenu. Munhu yoyose yolonda kuwa munhu mkulu, yawe msang'hanaji wa wose. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Na munhu yoyose yolonda kuwa wa ichanduso, yawe mtumwa wa wose. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Kwavija Mwana wa Munhu hezile kusang'hanilwa, lakini keza kuwasang'hanila wanhu na kuulava ugima wake kwa kuwakombola wanhu wengi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya msuwameso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Wavika Yeliko. Yesu na wanahina zake hamoja na lunhu lwa wanhu viwakalile osegela, msuwameso imoja yakalile yopula, twaga jake Batumayo, mwanage Timayo kakala mnzila. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Batumayo viyahulike Yesu wa Nazaleti kobita, kasonga kukemelela, “Yesu, mwanage Daudi nyonele bazi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Wanhu wengi wamkomhokela, wamulongela yanyamale, lakini heyo kagendelela kukemelela ng'hani, “Mwana wa Daudi, nyonele bazi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Yesu kema, kalonga, “Mkemeni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Avo wamkema, wamulongela, “Gangamala! Ima, kokukema.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Kawasa mgolole wake, kazumha kamcholela Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Kolonda nikutendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Munhu ayo kamwidika, “Mfundiza, nolonda kulola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Chola, kutamanila kwako kukuhonya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Bahaja kadaha kulola kamkweleleza Yesu mnzila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalemu kwa ng'henze</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Viwavikile behi na Yelusalemu, habehi na mabuga ga Betifage na Betania kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni, Yesu kawatuma wanahina zake wabili wamulongolele. <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>Kawalongela, “Gendeni kuna ikijiji kili kuulongozi wenu, mwahengila momvika mwana wa kihongwe kafungigwa, nayo yang'hali hanakweligwa na munhu. Mfunguleni mumgale hano. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Munhu yoyose yahawauza habali motenda avo, mulongeleni Mndewa komulonda, nayo kombweza sambi baha.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Wanahina waja wachola wamvika mwana wa kihongwe kafungigwa hana ulwivi lwa ng'anda uilola na nzila. Viwakalile omfungula, <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>wanhu wemile aho wawauza, “Motenda choni, habali momfungula ikihongwe?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Wawedika kamba Yesu viyawalongele, wanhu waja wawaleka wachole. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Wamgala imwana wa ikihongwe kwa Yesu, watandika viwalo vao mumgongo wa ikihongwe, Yesu kakwela uchanha. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Wanhu wengi wanzanza viwalo vao mnzila, na wayagwe wabena mibunho wayanzanza mnzila. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Wanhu wakalile kuchugu na kuulongozi wa Yesu wakemelela, “Imulungu yatogolwe! Mndewa Imulungu yamtambikile ayo yokwiza kwa twaga jake! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Imulungu yautambikile undewa ukwiza wa mndewa Daudi, muhenga wetu! Imulungu yeli uchanha ng'hani yatogolwe!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yesu kavika Yelusalemu, kachola kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu, kawegesela kuno na kuno. Lakini kwavija zuwa dikala dihongile, Yesu kachola Betania na wanahina zake longo na wabili.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodiduwila biki da mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayo 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Imitondo yake, viwakalile osegela Betania, Yesu kakala na nzala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Kwa kutali Yesu kajona biki da mtini dikalile na mijani mingi, avo kadicholela yalole kamba kodaha kupata tunda jojose lakini viyavikile aho honile tunda jojose, ila majani gaiyeka, kwavija haukalile msimu wa kulela. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Yesu kadilongela biki da mtini, “Munhu sikuyaje tunda jojose kumwako kabili!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Wanahina zake wamuhulika viyalongile vivo.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kochola kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Viwavikile Yelusalemu, Yesu kachola kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu. Kasonga kuwawinga wanhu wose wakalile ogula na kuchuuza vinhu. Kazibidula meza za wanhu wakalile ovunja sente na vigoda va wanhu wakalile ochuuza njiwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Kawagomesa sikuwasole kinhu chochose kubitila kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Abaho kawafundiza, “Yandikigwa mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile, ‘Ng'anda yangu yokuwa kae ya kupulila kwa wanhu wa isi zose.’ Lakini mweye moitenda mhango ya wabavi!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa viwahulike vivo, wasonga kuzahila nzila ya kumkoma Yesu, lakini wamdumba, kwavija lunhu lwa wanhu lukanganya mafundizo gake.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Viivikile ichungulo, Yesu na wanahina zake wasegela kudibuga.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da biki da mtini dinyalile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayo 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Imitootondo yake, viwakalile obita mnzila wajona biki dija da mtini dinyala gogodaa! <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Petulo kakumbuka kija kilawilile, kamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, lola, dibiki da mtini diudiduwile dinyala!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mumtogole Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Nowalongela ukweli, munhu yoyose yahakilongela kigongo kino, Ng'oka ukayase mbahali na hakona shaka muumoyo wake lakini kotogola kiyolonga cholawilila, na Imulungu komtendela. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Avo nowalongeleni, mwahampula Imulungu kinhu chochose, togoleni kamba mubokela, mogweleligwa chochose chonda mupule. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Mwahampula Imulungu geleni kumgongo nzambi ziwawatendele wanhu, ili Tataenu yeli kuulanga nayo yazigele kumgongo nzambi zenu zimutendile. <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Kamba hamuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu ziwawatendele, na Tataenu yeli kuulanga honda yazigele kumgongo bule nzambi zenu zimutendile.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Wavika kabili Yelusalemu, Yesu viyakalile kogenda kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu, wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wavele wamcholela, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>wamuuza, “Vino kotenda gano gose kwa udahi gani? Nani yakugwelele udahi wa kutenda gano?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yesu kawedika, “Na niye nowauza mbuli imoja, mwahanidika, baho nowalongeleni notenda gano kwa udahi gani. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Nongeleni, udahi wa Yohana wa kubatiza ulawa kwa Imulungu hebu kwa wanhu?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Wasonga kuilongela, “Twahalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa Imulungu,’ kotuuza, ‘Habali hamumtogole Yohana?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Lakini twahalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa wanhu,’” wawadumba wanhu, kwavija wanhu wamtogola Yohana kamba mtula ndagu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Avo wamwidika, “Siye hatujuwile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yesu kawalongela, “Na niye siwalongela bule kwa udahi gani notenda gano.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa walimaji mumgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Yesu kalonga nao kwa simo, “Munhu imoja kahanda mizabibu mumgunda wake. Kazungulusila lwigo mumgunda wake, kahimba hanhu ha kukamila zabibu, kazenga lingo. Abaho kawakodisha walimaji, kafunga mwanza kachola.<figure style="fig" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" ref="12:1">Wanhu wabili obojoga zabibu mna ihanhu ha kukamila zabibu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Msimu wa kubawa zabibu viuvikile, kamtuma msang'hanaji kwa awo walimaji yamgalile zabibu kulawa mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Lakini walimaji awo wamgoga, wamtowa, wamuwinga makono gaiyeka. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Abaho kamtuma msang'hanaji iyagwe, ayo nayo wamtowa mdipala na wamgela kinyala. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Mwene mgunda kamtuma msang'hanaji iyagwe, nayo wamkoma, na kawatuma wayagwe wengi wawatendela vivo, wayagwe wawatowa na wayagwe wawakoma. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Kakala kasigala na munhu imoja wa kumtuma, nayo kakala mwanage yamnogele ng'hani. Kamtuma kuno kolonga, ‘Omtegeleza mwanangu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Lakini walimaji wailongela, ‘Ino ayo muhazi, lekeni tumkome tusole uhazi wake!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Avo wamgoga, wamkoma wamwasila kunze ya umgunda wa imizabibu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>Yesu kawauza, “Vino mwene mgunda kotendaze? Kokwiza kuwakoma walimaji wose na kowakodisha walimaji wayagwe mgunda awo wa mizabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Hamgasomile Maandiko Gang'alile vigalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Dibwe wadilemile wazengaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">Sambi digalamuka dibwe kulu kubanza gose.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Mbuli ino itendigwa na Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">nayo yotukanganya!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Vilongozi wa Wayahudi walonda kumgoga Yesu, kwavija wajuwa lusimo luno kawalonga wao. Lakini waludumba lunhu lwa wanhu, avo wamuleka wasegela.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe na wanhu wa Helode wakala watumigwe kwa Yesu, wamgoge kwa mbuli zake. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Wamcholela wamulongela, “Mfundiza, tokujuwa gweye kwa munhu ulonga ukweli, humdumba munhu yoyose, hutonga ukulu wa munhu. Lakini gweye kofundiza goyolonda Imulungu wanhu wagatende. Tulongele, vino vinoga kuliha kodi kwa Mndewa wa Lumi hebu havinogile bule? Tulihe hebu sikutulihe?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Lakini Yesu kaujuwa ubala wao kawauza, “Habali monigeza? Ngalileni isente niilole.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Wamgalila isente, nayo kawauza, “Vino kihanga kino cha nani? Na twaga dino da nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Wamwidika, “Va Mndewa wa Lumi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mgweleleni Mndewa wa Lumi vili va Mndewa wa Lumi, na mgweleleni Imulungu vili va Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Nao wamkanganya Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuzilibuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Abaho Masadukayo, wanhu olonga kuduhu kuzilibuka kulawa kwa wafile. Wayagwe wamcholela Yesu wamulongela, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>“Mfundiza, Musa katwandikila, ‘Munhu yahafa na kuleka mwehe wake bila wana, ndugu yake munhu ayo kolondigwa yamsole mgane ayo, yamulelele ndugu yake yafile wana.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Kukala na ndugu saba, ija imkulu kasola mwehe kafa halekile wana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Wa kabili nayo kamuhala mgane ayo nayo vivija kafa halekile wana. Vivija kwa wa kadatu kafa halekile wana. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Abaho kwa wayagwe, wose saba wamsolile mgane ayo wafa hawalekile wana. Ako kumwande, mtwanzi ayo nayo kafa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Avo, wanhu wose wafile wahazilibuka mwiisiku ya kuzilibuka, mtwanzi ayo kokuwa mwehe wa nani? Kwavija wose saba wakala wamsolile.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mopotela! Kwavija hamugajuwile Maandiko Gang'alile hebu udahi wa Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Kwavija wanhu wafile vonda wazilibuke, hawasola wala hawasoligwa okuwa kamba wasenga wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Kwa mbuli ya kuzilibuka kwa wanhu wafile, hamusomile mna ikitabu cha Musa mbuli ya kisolo kikwaka? Imulungu kamulongela Musa, ‘Niye na Imulungu wa Abulahamu na wa Isaka na wa Yakobo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Heyo heli Imulungu wa wanhu wafile, ila Imulungu wa wanhu wagima. Avo mweye mopotela ng'hani!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lagizo kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Mfundiza Malagizo ga Musa imoja yakalile aho kahulika viwaibamilile. Kona kamba Yesu kawedika goya Masadukayo, avo kamkwesela Yesu kamuuza, “Mna Gamalagizo gose lagizo gani dili kulu?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Lagizo dili kulu ijo dino, ‘Tegelezeni mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli! Mndewa Imulungu wetu ayo Mndewa yaiyeka. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Mnogele Mndewa Imulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose na kwa loho yako yose na kwa nzewele zako zose na kwa nguvu zako zose.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Lagizo da kabili kwa ukulu ijo dino, ‘Mnogele miyago kamba viuinogela mwenyego.’ Kuduhu lagizo diyagwe kulu kubanza gano mabili.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Mfundiza Malagizo ga Musa kamtogola Yesu, “Mfundiza, kwidika goya viulongile, Mndewa ayo Imulungu na kuduhu iyagwe ila heyo. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Kumnogela Imulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose na kwa nzewele zako zose na kwa nguvu zako, na kumnogela miyago kamba viuinogela mwenyego, kunoga ng'hani kugoga Malagizo gano mabili kubanza kumulavila Imulungu nhosa za wanyama na nhosa ziyagwe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yesu viyonile munhu ayo kedika goya, kamulongela, “Huli kutali na Undewa wa Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Kusongela aho haduhu munhu yoyose yagezile kumuuza Yesu mbuli yoyose.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito Mkombola ayo nani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Yesu viyakalile kofundiza Mng'anda ya Imulungu, kawauza, “Habali wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa olonga Kilisito Mkombola mwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Loho Yang'alile kamulongoza Daudi kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Kala hano hana umwambu wa mkono wangu wa kudila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">mbaka niweke hasi mmagulu gako wanhu wakwihile.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>“Avo Daudi mwenyego kamkema, ‘Mndewa.’ Avo Kilisito Mkombola kodahaze kuwa mwana wa Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu kowazuma wanhu mbuli ya wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Lunhu lwa wanhu lukala lumtegeleza Yesu kwa kudeng'helela. <verse eid="MRK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Viyakalile kofundiza, kawalongela, “Muiteganye na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, onogelwa kugenda kuno ovala mikanzu mitali na kulamusigwa na wanhu mna gamagulilo, <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>osagula vigoda va haulongozi mzing'anda za kumpula Imulungu na kukala hanhu hanogile mna izinyimwilinyimwili. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Owaboka wagane vinhu na kusola ng'anda zao, abaho oilagusa wanoga kwa kumpula Imulungu mbuli nyingi. Nhaguso yao yokuwa ng'hulu!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya mgane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Yesu kakala behi na kigelo cha kulavila sadaka hana Ing'anda ya Imulungu, kawalola wanhu viwolava sente mkigelo. Matajili wengi walava sente nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Abaho keza mgane mkiwa kalava sente mbili ndodo. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Yesu kawakema wanahina zake kawalongela, “Nowalongela ukweli mgane mkiwa ino kalava sente nyingi mna ikigelo cha sadaka kubanza wose wayagwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Kwavija wose walava vija visigale muutajili wao, lakini mgane ino hamoja na ukiwa wake kalava vose viyelinavo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya kubanangika kwa Ng'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Yesu viyakalile kosegela kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu, mwanahina wake imoja kamulongela, “Mfundiza, lola mabwe gano na ng'anda zino vizinogile!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Kozona ng'anda zino vizili ng'hulu? Haduhu dibwe donda dilekigwe uchanha ya diyagwe, kila dibwe dokwasigwa hasi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya na kudununzika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Yesu viyakalile kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni, mwambu kwa mwambu na Ng'anda ya Imulungu, baho Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana na Andeleya wamcholela Yesu kinyelegezi. <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>Wamulongela, “Tulongele, choni chonda kitendeke kulagusa kipindi cha kulawilila gano gose?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Muiteganye, munhu yoyose sikuyawavizile. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Wanhu wengi, okwiza kwa twaga jangu na kulonga, ‘Nene iyo heyo!’ Nao owavizila wanhu wengi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Mwahahulika mbuli za ng'hondo kutali na mbuli za ng'hondo mmabehi, sikumudumbe, kwavija gano gose golondigwa galawilile, ila kimambukizo king'hali hakinavika. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Isi yoitowa na isi iyagwe, undewa oitowa na undewa uyagwe. Kila hanhu hokuwa na mitigisiko mikulu ya isi na lufilili lwa nzala. Gano gose kamba mwanduso wa usungu wa kulela mwana.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>“Na mweye muiteganye. Mogogigwa na kugaligwa mkitala. Motoigwa mna izing'anda za kumpula Imulungu, mogaligwa haulongozi wa wakulu wa isi na wandewa mbuli ya niye, ili muwalongele Mbuli Inogile. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Lakini kimambukizo king'hali hakinavika, Mbuli Inogile tanhu yolondigwa ipetigwe kwa wanhu wose. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Mwahagogigwa na kugaligwa mkitala, sikumunyawenyawe mbuli ya kulonga. Kipindi chahavika longeni chochose chonda mugweleligwe. Kwavija mbuli zonda mulonge hazili zenu, ila zolawa kwa Loho Yang'alile. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Munhu komuhinduka ndugu yake too yakomigwe, na tata komuhinduka mwanage yakomigwe. Wana owahinduka tata zao na mama zao wakomigwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Wanhu wose owehila mweye mbuli ya niye, lakini yoyose yonda yafunge umoyo mbaka kukimambukizo kokomboligwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Magayo makulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>“Vondamuchone, ‘Kinhu kinyolodoke kigala Ubananzi’ kima hanhu si hake. Munhu yosoma yavijuwe, waja weli mwiisi ya Yudea wakimbilile kuna ivigongo. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Munhu yeli mkiswili cha ng'anda yake sikuyahumuluke hasi mna ing'anda yake kusola kinhu. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Yeli kumgunda sikuyabwele ukae kusola kiwalo chake. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Ogaya watwanzi wali na zinda na waja okong'heza mna izisiku azo. <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Mpuleni Imulungu mbuli zino sikuzilawilile mna ikipindi cha kihuhwe! <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Kwavija siku azo hokuwa na magayo makulu, haganalawila kulawa kuna ichanduso Imulungu viyalumbile isi mbaka sambi na honda galawilile kabili. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Lakini Imulungu kazihunguza siku zizo, maza hazihunguze sambi yahone munhu yoyose. Lakini mbuli ya wanhu zake yawasagule, Imulungu kazihunguza siku zizo.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>“Avo, munhu yoyose yahawalongela, ‘Amweye, Kilisito kahano!’ hebu ‘Kahaja!’ sikumumtogole. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Kwavija olawilila makilisito na watula ndagu wa uvizi. Otenda unzonza na vilaguso ili yahadahika wawavizile hata waja wasaguligwe na Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Muiteganye! Niye niwalongela kila kinhu kipindi king'hali hakinavika.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>“Gahamala magayo ga siku azo, zuwa dokuwa ziza, na mbalamwezi honda imwemwese bule, <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>nhondo zolagala kulawa kuulanga, na vinhu vili kuulanga votigisika. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Abaho Mwana wa Munhu kolawilila, kokwiza mna gamawingu kwa nguvu ng'hulu na ukulu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Abaho kowatuma wasenga zake wa kuulanga mna izibanzi nne za mwiisi, waweke hamoja wanhu wasaguligwe na Imulungu kulawa mwambu uno wa isi na uyagwe.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da biki da mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>“Ifunzeni kubitila biki da mtini. Matambi gake gahasonga kuzuka na kwika majani, mujuwe kamba vuli da mmabehi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Vivija, mwahazona mbuli azo, mojuwa kamba kammabehi kwiza. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, wanhu wa lukolo luno hawafa wose mbaka gano gose galawilile. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Ulanga na isi vobita, lakini mbuli zangu hondazibite ng'o.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhu munhu yaijuwile siku hebu saa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayo 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>“Kuduhu yaijuwile siku hebu saa ya kwiza, siyo wasenga wa kuulanga wala Mwana, lakini Tata yaiyeka ayo yaijuwile. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Muiteganye, na mukale meso, kwavija Hamkijuwile kipindi chonda yeze. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Yokuwa kamba munhu yofunga mwanza na kuwaleka wasang'hanaji zake walolese goya vinhu, kila munhu kamgwaa sang'hano ya kutenda. Kamulagiza mkalizi wa mulango yakale meso. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Muiteganye, kwavija hamujuwile kipindi cha kwiza mkulu wa ng'anda, yodaha kuwa ichungulo, kilo kikulu, nzogolo zikwika, hebu imitondo. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Yaheza kwa kuwasinhusa, sikuyawavike muwasile. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Mbuli iniwalongele mweye, nowalongela wanhu wose, kaleni meso!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Kiseto cha kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Zikala zisigale siku mbili ivike Nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka na Magate haganageligwa hamila. Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakala ozahila nzila ya kumgoga Yesu wamkome. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Walonga, “Sikututende avo kipindi cha Nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka, buleavo wanhu oding'huka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobakigwa mavuta ako Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yesu kakala Betania mng'anda ya Simoni, munhu yakalile na utamu wa dikulu. Viyakalile koja, mtwanzi imoja keza na nyhupa ya alabasita imemile mavuta gonung'hila goya ga bei ng'hulu. Kaifungula, kamgidila Yesu gamavuta mdipala. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Wanhu wayagwe wakalile aho wagevuzika, wailongela, “Unanzi gani uno wa mavuta!” <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Abaho wamkomhokela mtwanzi ayo, walonga, “Mavuta gano gahauzigwe kwa sente magana madatu na zisente wagweleligwe wakiwa!”<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Lakini Yesu kawalongela, “Mulekeni, habali momgaza mtwanzi ino? Niye kanhendela mbuli inogile. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Wanhu wakiwa mokala nao siku zose, saa yoyose mwahalonda modaha kuwataza. Lakini honda mukale na niye siku zose. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Mtwanzi ino katenda viyadahile, kalongola kulubakaza lukuli lwangu mavuta ganogile, kulutanda kwa kuzikigwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, kokose konda ipetigwe Mbuli Inogile mwiisi, kino kiyatendile mtwanzi ino cholongigwa, avo wanhu omkumbuka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotogola kumuhinduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Abaho imoja wa wanahina zake longo na wabili yakemigwe Yuda Isikaliote, kachola kwa wakulu wa walava nhosa yamuhinduke Yesu kumwao. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Avo viwahulike kiyalongile wadeng'helela, na wailagana nayo kumgwaa sente. Avo Yuda kasonga kuzahila nzila ya kumgela Yesu mmakono gao.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koja ndiya ya Pasaka na wanahina zake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Mna isiku ya ichanduso ya Nyimwilinyimwili ya Magate hagageligwe Usasu, siku dijo mwana ng'hondolo wa Pasaka kochinjigwa, wanahina zake Yesu wamuuza, “Kolonda tuchole kwahi tukutandile ndiya ya Pasaka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Yesu kawatuma wanahina zake wabili kawalongela, “Gendeni kudibuga, momting'hana mbigalo kaidikwa nongo ya mazi. Mkwelelezeni, <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>mbaka mng'anda yonda yengile, mulongeleni mwenekae, ‘Mfundiza kolonga, da kwahi gati da kudila ndiya ya Pasaka niye na wanahina zangu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Nayo kowalagusila gati kulu dili uchanha dikigwa goya na dihambigwa. Mumo tutandileni.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Wanahina zake wasegela, wachola kudibuga, wavika kila kinhu vivija viyawalongele Yesu, avo wamtandila ndiya ya Pasaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Viivikile ichungulo, Yesu kavika na wanahina zake longo na wabili. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Viwakalile oja, Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongeleni imoja wenu yoja na niye, konihinduka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Wanahina zake wanyawanyawa, wamuuza, imoja imoja, “Vino gweye kolonga niye?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Yesu kawedika, “Imoja wenu mweye longo na wabili, yozanhika gate jake hamoja na niye mbakuli. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Mwana wa Munhu kofa kamba Maandiko Gang'alile vigolonga. Lakini kogaya munhu ija yomuhinduka Mwana wa Munhu. Yahanogile ng'hani kamba munhu ayo sambi yavumbuke!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndiya ya Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Viwakalile oja, Yesu kasola gate, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kadibanzula na kawagwaa wanahina zake kalonga, “Soleni, uno ulo lukuli lwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Abaho kasola kikasi cha divai, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kawagwaa wanahina zake, wose waking'wela. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Yesu kalonga, “Ino ayo damu yangu ilagusa lagano da Imulungu, ikwitika mbuli ya wanhu wengi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Nowalongela, kusongela sambi honda ning'we kabili divai, mbaka siku dijo donda ning'we divai ya sambi Muundewa wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Abaho wemba lwila, wachola kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagula Petulo kombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye mose mokimbila na kundeka niiyeka, kwavija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, ‘Imulungu komtowa msusilaji, na ng'hondolo wose opwililika.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Lakini nahazilibuka, nowalongolela kuchola Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Petulo kamwidika Yesu, “Hata kamba wose wahakuleka, niye sikuleka bule!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yesu kamulongela Petulo, “Nokulongela ukweli, kilo cha lelo nzogolo yang'hali hana kwika miyanza mibili, konibela miyanza midatu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Petulo kagangamiza kulonga, “Silonga vivo bule, hata kamba nahafa na gweye!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Na wanahina wayagwe walonga vivo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kompula Imulungu ako Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wavika hanhu hokemigwa Getisemane, Yesu kawalongela, “Kaleni hano, niye nogenda kumpula Imulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Kawasola Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana. Yesu kona usungu na kanyunyuwala. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Kawalongela wanahina zake, “Usungu uli muumoyo wangu mkulu ng'hani odaha kung'homa. Kaleni hano meso.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Kachola kumwande kidogo, kaibwanha hasi, kampula Imulungu, kamba yahadahika sikuyaibitile saa ayo ya madununzo. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Kampula Imulungu, “Tata! Kumwako gose godahika. Ukisegese kikasi kino cha madununzo. Lakini siyo kamba vinilonda niye ila viulonda gweye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Abaho kabwela kawavika wanahina zake wadatu wawasa. Kamulongela Petulo, “Simoni kuwasa? Vino hamudahile kukala meso hata saa dimoja?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Kawalongela, “Kaleni meso, mumpule Imulungu sikumwingile mna ukugezigwa. Moyo wa munhu olonda kutenda ganogile, lakini lukuli lwabule nguvu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Kachola lwa kabili kumpula Imulungu, kalonga mbuli zizija. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Viyabwelile kabili, kawavika wanahina zake wawasa, kwavija meso gao gakala na utulo. Hawaijuwile mbuli yakumulongela Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Viyabwelile mwanza wa kadatu, kawalongela, “Mung'hali muwasa na kubwihila? Yotosha! Kipindi kivika! Loleni, Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu wene nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Lamukeni, tuchole. Loleni munhu yonihinduka kavika!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yogendelela kulonga, imoja wa wanahina zake longo na wabili, yakemigwe Yuda Isikaliote kavika. Keza na lunhu lutumigwe na wakulu wa walava nhosa, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wavele, kuno wapapa mapanga na malungu. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Yuda Isikaliote yomuhinduka Yesu kawagwaa kilaguso, kawalongela, “Munhu yonda nimnonele ayo yummulonda. Mgogeni mumgele mmakono genu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Bahaja Yuda kamcholela Yesu kamulongela, “Mfundiza!” Abaho kamnonela. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Avo wamgoga Yesu wamgodeka. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Lakini imoja wa waja wakalile na Yesu, kasomola panga jake, kamkanha digwiti msang'hanaji wa Mkulu wa walava nhosa. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Vino habali mwizile kungoga na mapanga na malungu kamba vija nambavi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Kila siku ng'hala na mweye, nowafundiza kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu, hamnigogile. Lakini gano gatendeka ili Maandiko Gang'alile galawilile.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Abaho wanahina wose wamuleka wakimbila.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Mbwanga imoja yavalile mgolole wiiyeka, kakala yomkweleleza Yesu. Walonda kumgoga, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>lakini kauleka mgolole wake, kakimbila mwazi.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamkitala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Abaho Yesu kagaligwa mng'anda ya Mkulu wa walava nhosa, mumo wakulu wa walava nhosa wose, wavele na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa waiting'hana. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Petulo kamkweleleza Yesu kwa kutali, kengila muuluwa lwa mkulu wa walava nhosa, kakala hasi na wakalizi, kokotela moto. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wanhu wose wa mkitala wazahila usindila wa uvizi ili wamkome Yesu, lakini hawaupatile bule. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Wanhu wengi walonga mbuli za uvizi kwa Yesu, lakini usindila wao hauwilumbile.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Abaho wanhu wayagwe wema walonga mbuli za uvizi kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>Walonga, “Tumuhulika kolonga, ‘Noibomola Ng'anda ino ya Imulungu izengigwe na wanhu, na kwa siku ndatu noizenga iyagwe haizengigwe na wanhu.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Na awo vivija usindila wao hauwilumbile.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Mkulu wa walava nhosa kenuka mgameso ga wanhu kamuuza Yesu, “Vino kuduhu mbuli ya kwidika kwa kitala choolava wanhu wano?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Lakini Yesu kanyamala tuluu, halongile mbuli, Mkulu wa walava nhosa kamuuza kabili, “Gweye ayo Kilisito Mkombola, Mwana wa ija Yotogoligwa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nene iyo heyo. Mweye momona Mwana wa Munhu kakala muukulu mwambu wa mkono wa kudila wa Imulungu yeli na Udahi, kokwiza mna gamawingu ga kuulanga!”<verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Mkulu wa walava nhosa kakidega kiwalo chake, kalonga, “Hatulonda usindila uyagwe! <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Muhulika viyomuliga Imulungu. Mweye mogesaze?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Wose walonga, kabananga kolondigwa yakomigwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamtemela mate Yesu, wamgubika gameso, wamtowa na wamulongela, “Lagula, nani yakutowile!” Abaho wakalizi wamsola wamtowa ng'hofi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Petulo viyakalile yang'hali hasi muuluwa, msang'hanaji imoja wa kitwanzi wa mkulu wa walava nhosa kamcholela. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Viyamone Petulo kokotela moto, kamulola bunhuu kamulongela, “Gweye vivija kukala hamoja na Yesu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Petulo kabela, “Bule, sijuwile kiulonga.” Abaho Petulo kalawa kunze mbaka kuna uluhelengo. Bahaja nzogolo keka.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Msang'hanaji ija wa kitwanzi kamona Petulo, kawalongela wanhu wemile aho, “Ino nayo imoja wao!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Lakini Petulo kabela kabili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Hamwande kidogo wanhu wakalile wemile aho wamulongela Petulo kabili, “Gweye vivija kwa imoja wao, kwavija kwa mwenekae wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Petulo kalonga, “Imulungu kojuwa nolonga ukweli, niduwiligwe nahalonga uvizi, simjuwile munhu yumulonga!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Bahaja nzogolo keka mwanza wa kabili, baho Petulo kakumbuka mbuli ziyalongeligwe na Yesu, “Nzogolo yang'hali hanakwika miyanza mibili, konibela miyanza midatu.” Avo Petulo kasonga kulila.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Imitootondo, wakulu wa walava nhosa, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, wavele na wanhu wose wa mkitala waiting'hana, waitogolela kumgala Yesu kwa Pilato. Wamgodeka nzabi, wamgala kwa Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Pilato kamuuza Yesu, “Gweye ayo Mndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesu kamwidika, “Ona, vivo viulonga.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa wamulavila Yesu vitala vingi, <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>avo Pilato kamuuza Yesu kabili, “Hulonda kwidika? Tegeleza viwokulavila vitala!”<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Lakini Yesu hedike mbuli yoyose, Pilato kakanganya.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotagusigwa yafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Yahavikaga Nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka Pilato kamfungulilaga mfungwa imoja wamulondile wanhu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Mna ikipindi acho kukala na munhu imoja twaga jake Balaba, kakala yagodekigwe mkifungo na wayage, mbuli ya ukomaji kipindi wanhu viwading'huke. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu viluiting'hane, lumpula Pilato yawatendele kamba viyatendaga. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pilato kawauza, “Molonda niwafungulileni mndewa wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Pilato kajuwa goya kamba wakulu wa walava nhosa wamgela Yesu mmakono gake kwavija wamonela migongo.<verse eid="MRK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Lakini wakulu wa walava nhosa wawading'hula wanhu wampule Pilato yawafungulile Balaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Pilato kaluuza kabili lunhu luja, “Vino molonda nhende choni kwa munhu ino yumumkema mndewa wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Wanhu wose wakemelela, “Muwambe mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pilato kawauza, “Vino kabananga choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Awo wagendelela kukemelela, “Muwambe mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Pilato kalonda kulunogeza lunhu lwa wanhu, avo kamfungulila Balaba mkifungo. Abaho kalagiza Yesu yatoigwe mbalati na yawambigwe mumsalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wakalizi omzeha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matayo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Wakalizi wamgala Yesu muuluwa lwa ng'anda ya mkulu wa isi, waiting'hana na wayao wose. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Wamvaza kiwalo cha Undewa, waluka ngata ya miba, waika mdipala jake. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Wamulamusa, “Mwinyi, Mndewa wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Wamtowa mbalati mdipala wamtemela mate, wamfugamila na kumwinamila. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Viwamambukize kumzeha, wamvula ikiwalo cha Undewa wamvaza viwalo vake. Abaho wamulava kunze wamuwambe mumsalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambigwa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Viwakalile mnzila wamting'hana munhu imoja twaga jake Simoni, mwenekae wa Kilene, tatao Alekizanda na Lufo. Kipindi acho kakala kolawa kumgunda, wakalizi wamnanahiza yaupape msalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Wamgala Yesu mbaka hanhu hokemigwa Goligota, fambulo jake, “Hanhu ha Fumvu da Pala.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Wamgwaa Yesu divai ihanganyigwe na kinhu kili usungu, lakini Yesu kalema kung'wa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Abaho wamuwamba Yesu mumsalaba, waigolela viwalo vake, kwa kubwanha simbi, ili ijuwike simbi yomgwila nani avo yasole ikiwalo. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Ikala saa ndatu imitondo viwamuwambile Yesu mumsalaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Wandika kilamuso cha kutagusigwa kwake, chandikigwa vino, “Mndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Vivija wawawamba wabavi wabili hamoja na Yesu, imoja mwambu wake wa mkono wa kudila na iyagwe mwambu wake wa kumoso. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Avo galawilila Maandiko Gang'alile galongile, “Kekigwa hamoja na wanhu watendile gehile.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Wabita nzila watigisa mapala gao wamuliga Yesu, walonga, “Gweye kulonga koibomola Ng'anda ya Imulungu na kuizenga kabili kwa siku ndatu! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Lelo humuluka mumsalaba uikombole mwenyego!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Vivija wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wamzeha Yesu walonga, “Kawakombola wayagwe, lakini hadaha kuikombola mwenyego! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Leka tumulole Kilisito Mkombola, Mndewa wa Izilaeli, lelo yahahumuluka mumsalaba na siye tomtogola!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Vivija na wanhu waja wabili wawambigwe hamoja na Yesu wamuliga.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Viivikile saa sita imisi, isi yose ikala igubikigwe na ziza totolo, ziza dijo dikala kwa masaa madatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Viivikile saa tisa imisi, Yesu kalila kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Eloi, Eloi, lama, sabakitani?” Fambulo jake, “Imulungu wangu, Imulungu wangu, habali kundeka?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Wanhu wayagwe wemile aho viwamuhulike, walonga, “Tegelezeni, komkema Eliya!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Munhu imoja kakimbila kavabika dodoki mwiidivai, kadinanika mulubiki, kadika mmulomo wa Yesu, kalonga, “Beta tulole kamba Eliya kokwiza kumuhumulusa mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Yesu kalila kwa sauti ng'hulu, abaho kafa.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Panziya da Ng'anda ya Imulungu digola gati da Ng'anda ya Imulungu na hanhu hong'ala ng'hani, didegeka mhande mbili, kulawa uchanha mbaka hasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Mkulu wa wakalizi yemile haulongozi ha msalaba kamona Yesu viyafile, kalonga, “Kweli munhu ino kakala Mwana wa Imulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Baho kukala na watwanzi wayagwe wakalile olola kwa kutali. Mna iwao kakala Malia Magidalena, Malia mamao Yakobo mdodo na Yusufu na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Watwanzi awo wamkweleleza Yesu viyakalile Galilaya na kumsang'hanila. Watwanzi wayagwe wezile nayo Yelusalemu vivija wakala aho.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzikigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Viivikile ichungulo ing'hali hainavika siku ya Kubwihila. Wayahudi wakala oitanda kwa siku ayo ya Kubwihila. <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Yusufu mwenekae wa Alimataya, imoja wa wakulu wa Mkitala cha Wayahudi yategelezigwe ng'hani kavika. Munhu ino kakala kobetela kwiza kwa Undewa wa Imulungu. Avo kamgendela Pilato bila kudumba, kampula yamgwee lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Pilato kakanganya kuhulika Yesu kafa. Kamkema mkulu wa wakalizi kamuuza kamba Yesu kakala yafile mwaka. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Pilato viyalongeligwe avo na mkulu wa wakalizi kamba Yesu kafa, kamulongela Yusufu yalusole lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Yusufu kagula sitili, kaluhumulusa lukuli lwa Yesu, kaluzingiliza sitili kalwika mdipanga disongoligwe mdibwe. Abaho kabimbilisa dibwe kulu kadigubika mmulomo wa dipanga. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Malia Magidalena na Malia mamake Yusufu wahona hanhu halwikigwe lukuli lwa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kozilibuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Viimalile siku ya Kubwihila, Malia Magidalena, Malia mamake Yakobo na Salome wagula mavuta gonung'hila goya wachola kulubakaza lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Imitootondo ng'hani mna isiku ya jumapili, zuwa vidisongile kulawa wachola kudipanga. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Viwakalile mnzila wailongela, “Nani yonda yatubimbilisile idibwe hamgwazo wa umulomo wa dipanga?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Lakini viwalolile wona dibwe dija dibimbilisigwa mwaka hamgwazo. Dikala dibwe kulu ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Avo wengila mdipanga, wamona mbwanga imoja yavalile kiwalo kizelu, kakala mkono wa kudila, wadumba ng'hani.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Kawalongela, “Sikumudumbe nojuwa momzahila Yesu wa Nazaleti yawambigwe mumsalaba. Kahaduhu hano, kazilibuka! Loleni hanhu hawamwikile. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Avo choleni mkawalongele wanahina zake na Petulo, ‘Yesu kowalongolela Galilaya, kuko momona kamba viyawalongele.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Avo walawa mdipanga, kuno ogwaya na kudumba, wakimbila. Hawamulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ino kwavija wakala odumba.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komulawilila Malia Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohana 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Yesu viyazilibuke mwiisiku ya Jumapili imitootondo, tanhu kamulawilila Malia Magidalena, ija yamulavile vinyamkela saba. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Nayo kachola kuwalongela waja wakalile na Yesu, wakala wang'hali oiyalala na kulila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Viwamuhulike Malia Magidalena kolonga kamba Yesu mgima na kamona, hawamtogolele bule.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawilila wanahina wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Abaho Yesu kawalawilila wanahina zake wabili mna ikihanga kiyagwe, wanahina awo wakala ochola kumgunda. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Nao wabweleganya na kuwalongela wayao, lakini hawawatogolele bule.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawilila wanahina zake longo na imoja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sang'hano 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Kukimambukizo Yesu kawalawilila wanahina zake longo na imoja viwakalile woja. Kawakomhokela kwavija wakala wabule kutamanila na wakala wadala kuwatogolela waja wamonile viyazilibuke. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Kawalongela, “Choleni mwiisi yose mukawapetele wanhu wose Mbuli Inogile. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Munhu yoyose yotogola na kubatizigwa, kokomboligwa, lakini munhu yoyose yolema kutogola kotagusigwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Wanhu wose otogola ogweleligwa udahi wa kutenda unzonza, kwa twaga jangu olava vinyamkela, olonga ulonzi wa sambi, <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>wahagoga mizoka hebu wahang'wa sumu hondawatendigwe kinhu chochose kihile, owekila wanhu watamu makono gao, nao ohona.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Sang'hano 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Mndewa Yesu viyamambukize kulonga na wanahina zake, kagaligwa kuulanga, kakala muukulu mwambu wa mkono wa kudila wa Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Abaho wanahina zake wachola kila hanhu kuwapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile. Na Mndewa kasang'hana nao na unzonza wautendile ulagusa kamba usenga wao ukala wa ukweli.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
